00:10:02,800 --> 00:10:03,880
Someone's opening a package!

276
00:10:03,880 --> 00:10:04,480
Who are you?

277
00:10:05,120 --> 00:10:05,800
Someone's opening a package!

278
00:10:06,960 --> 00:10:08,080
30 seconds deducted.

279
00:10:10,720 --> 00:10:11,920
Someone's opening a package.

280
00:10:11,920 --> 00:10:12,520
Opening a package!

281
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:16,480
30 seconds deducted.

282
00:10:16,500 --> 00:10:20,140
(Keep opening it somewhere else)

283
00:10:20,220 --> 00:10:21,260
(Item -1)

284
00:10:22,980 --> 00:10:25,940
(There's another box inside the box)

285
00:10:28,780 --> 00:10:32,500
(Medicine bottle)

286
00:10:35,060 --> 00:10:37,620
(Life is getting beaten up
and working for nothing)

287
00:10:39,020 --> 00:10:41,820
(Working for nothing +1)

288
00:10:51,700 --> 00:10:53,940
(Betrayed from within)
Why are you throwing up?

289
00:10:54,600 --> 00:10:55,800
Take a break.

290
00:10:56,160 --> 00:10:57,600
Someone's actually telling me
to take a break?

291
00:10:57,600 --> 00:10:58,560
(Is that really okay?)
This room is full of people.

292
00:10:58,560 --> 00:10:59,880
How can I take a break now?

293
00:11:00,840 --> 00:11:01,680
It's packed with people.

294
00:11:02,880 --> 00:11:04,160
Who knows what you're here to steal?

295
00:11:04,160 --> 00:11:05,980
(Agile dodging)

296
00:11:06,020 --> 00:11:09,380
(Beating up thin air)

297
00:11:13,780 --> 00:11:15,540
(A combination lockbox)

298
00:11:18,820 --> 00:11:20,140
(Let the expert handle the expert work)

299
00:11:20,160 --> 00:11:21,840
What day did his grandma die?

300
00:11:22,600 --> 00:11:24,280
Was it May 24 or March 29?

301
00:11:27,940 --> 00:11:29,260
(Let's put our heads together)

302
00:11:29,280 --> 00:11:30,040
What's this?

303
00:11:30,040 --> 00:11:30,400
I don't know.

304
00:11:32,240 --> 00:11:32,720
Passcode.

305
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:35,480
Seven, seven, seven.

306
00:11:35,700 --> 00:11:37,420
(Li Attention's address:
777 Happiness Road, Room 2222)

307
00:11:37,460 --> 00:11:40,340
(The code isn't 777)

308
00:11:40,980 --> 00:11:43,020
(Challenge failed)
Time's up.

309
00:11:43,040 --> 00:11:44,800
We found a combination lock.

310
00:11:45,560 --> 00:11:46,880
It's a three-digit code.

311
00:11:47,680 --> 00:11:48,560
Seven, seven, seven.

312
00:11:48,560 --> 00:11:50,160
777 Happiness Road.

313
00:11:50,160 --> 00:11:51,160
(One wrong option eliminated)
I just tried it.

314
00:11:51,160 --> 00:11:51,920
Nope.

315
00:11:51,920 --> 00:11:53,000
I just tried that.

316
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:54,160
Was it 309?

317
00:11:54,460 --> 00:11:55,860
(Li Attention's date of death: March 9)
Three, zero, nine.

318
00:11:56,800 --> 00:11:57,560
Three, zero, nine doesn't work.

319
00:11:58,160 --> 00:11:59,560
How many letters are in "Li Attention"?

320
00:11:59,560 --> 00:12:01,520
One, two, three, four, five, six.

321
00:12:01,520 --> 00:12:02,560
Try six, six, seven.

322
00:12:02,620 --> 00:12:04,260
(Absurd, but we'll take it)

323
00:12:04,360 --> 00:12:05,280
His character letters.

324
00:12:05,280 --> 00:12:05,800
Nope.

325
00:12:05,800 --> 00:12:06,760
(Jin Pretty, played by Jin Jing)

326
00:12:06,760 --> 00:12:08,320
I don't think it's outside.

327
00:12:08,320 --> 00:12:09,800
It should be inside that keypad lock.

328
00:12:09,800 --> 00:12:10,680
(Ke Cutie, played by Zhou Keyu)
There's a key.

329
00:12:10,680 --> 00:12:11,360
We can open that one.

330
00:12:11,360 --> 00:12:12,120
Then it's inside there.

331
00:12:12,540 --> 00:12:14,540
(Guess: A key inside opens the cabinet
to the medicine bottle)

332
00:12:14,540 --> 00:12:15,380
(EMO Fly Away)

333
00:12:17,280 --> 00:12:18,320
There's also a string of numbers
on the outside.

334
00:12:18,320 --> 00:12:19,160
Does that mean anything?

335
00:12:19,340 --> 00:12:21,540
(Ning 2K, played by Liu Yuning)

336
00:12:21,560 --> 00:12:22,360
What is this?

337
00:12:23,060 --> 00:12:24,300
(There's a string of numbers
on the cover)

338
00:12:24,880 --> 00:12:26,040
I got it. It's a puzzle.

339
00:12:26,800 --> 00:12:27,920
It's subtraction.

340
00:12:28,400 --> 00:12:29,680
(It's a subtraction problem)
This is 9,999.

341
00:12:30,280 --> 00:12:32,200
11,111

342
00:12:32,200 --> 00:12:33,040
minus 999

343
00:12:33,040 --> 00:12:34,120
minus 3,333,

344
00:12:34,120 --> 00:12:35,240
then minus 6,666.

345
00:12:35,300 --> 00:12:37,020
(Automatically looks over)
How do you solve this?

346
00:12:37,760 --> 00:12:38,920
You're the one who solves these.
You do it.

347
00:12:41,160 --> 00:12:41,920
I can't move.

348
00:12:42,520 --> 00:12:43,720
9,999...

349
00:12:43,720 --> 00:12:44,760
Equals two.

350
00:12:45,280 --> 00:12:46,640
Let me see. Two...

351
00:12:46,640 --> 00:12:47,760
Come on, the science guy.

352
00:12:48,240 --> 00:12:49,160
11,113.

353
00:12:49,920 --> 00:12:51,200
It's a three-digit number.

354
00:12:52,460 --> 00:12:53,340
(Brain cells have stopped functioning)

355
00:12:53,480 --> 00:12:53,920
Wait.

356
00:12:53,920 --> 00:12:55,400
10,000 minus 9,999

357
00:12:55,400 --> 00:12:56,280
equals one.

358
00:13:00,680 --> 00:13:03,160
1,112 minus 999

359
00:13:03,160 --> 00:13:05,400
equals 113.

360
00:13:05,400 --> 00:13:06,040
One, one, three.

361
00:13:08,440 --> 00:13:09,200
It opened!

362
00:13:09,200 --> 00:13:10,620
(Successfully cracked the lockbox)

363
00:13:10,660 --> 00:13:12,140
(Mental math genius)

364
00:13:14,700 --> 00:13:16,220
(Approved)

365
00:13:16,560 --> 00:13:18,520
But what the heck is this?

366
00:13:19,700 --> 00:13:21,140
(It's just an ordinary medicine bottle)

367
00:13:21,440 --> 00:13:23,520
Who did all that work for?

368
00:13:24,760 --> 00:13:26,700
(What was I even calculating?)
I give up.

369
00:13:27,200 --> 00:13:28,960
(Nan Do, played by Zhang Ruonan)
How come you two...

370
00:13:28,960 --> 00:13:30,160
You didn't see the numbers?

371
00:13:30,360 --> 00:13:31,560
Or did you pretend not to notice?

372
00:13:31,560 --> 00:13:33,040
(You two are suspicious)

373
00:13:33,040 --> 00:13:34,600
I saw them.
I just didn't have time to think.

374
00:13:35,200 --> 00:13:36,560
I just didn't figure it out.

375
00:13:36,560 --> 00:13:36,880
Right.

376
00:13:37,380 --> 00:13:39,340
(It can't be that simple)

377
00:13:39,760 --> 00:13:40,680
You're suspicious of me now?

378
00:13:40,680 --> 00:13:41,440
You really suspect me?

379
00:13:42,440 --> 00:13:42,800
It's fine.

380
00:13:43,800 --> 00:13:45,160
Let's not blame anyone yet.

381
00:13:45,160 --> 00:13:45,600
That...

382
00:13:45,600 --> 00:13:46,520
(The grudge is on file.
We'll settle it later)

383
00:13:46,520 --> 00:13:47,520
So let's confirm

384
00:13:47,520 --> 00:13:48,920
who searched for what.

385
00:13:48,920 --> 00:13:50,400
Later, wherever that key turns up,

386
00:13:50,400 --> 00:13:51,040
we will...

387
00:13:51,040 --> 00:13:51,440
Okay.

388
00:13:51,440 --> 00:13:52,120
We'll blame that person.

389
00:13:52,120 --> 00:13:52,360
Okay.

390
00:13:52,360 --> 00:13:53,110
(He Da, played by Zhang Linghe)
Okay?

391
00:13:53,120 --> 00:13:54,000
Okay.

392
00:13:54,920 --> 00:13:55,920
(One last chance)
The countdown starts now.

393
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:57,920
It's started.

394
00:14:00,040 --> 00:14:00,280
No.

395
00:14:00,940 --> 00:14:03,740
(Leave no spot unchecked)

396
00:14:15,520 --> 00:14:17,220
(Losing patience)
Where's your stuff?

397
00:14:17,680 --> 00:14:18,760
What?

398
00:14:19,180 --> 00:14:20,000
(Beating the air again)

399
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:21,640
Where's your stuff?

400
00:14:22,760 --> 00:14:24,440
(Keeping calm on my own)
What stuff?

401
00:14:24,440 --> 00:14:25,960
What stuff?

402
00:14:26,380 --> 00:14:27,980
(Being a little cheeky)

403
00:14:32,460 --> 00:14:34,180
(The medicine bottle falls
from behind the curtain)

404
00:14:39,800 --> 00:14:40,280
Is this it?

405
00:14:40,280 --> 00:14:41,320
This one.

406
00:14:41,320 --> 00:14:41,960
Is it?

407
00:14:41,960 --> 00:14:42,760
Open it.

408
00:14:42,760 --> 00:14:43,560
Is it this one?

409
00:14:43,560 --> 00:14:44,660
(Medicine bottle clues: 1. Red label)

410
00:14:44,660 --> 00:14:45,900
(2. "EMO Fly Away" label inside the cap)

411
00:14:45,980 --> 00:14:47,560
(Found the right medicine bottle)

412
00:14:47,560 --> 00:14:48,640
Found it.

413
00:14:49,520 --> 00:14:50,760
Give it to him.

414
00:14:51,040 --> 00:14:51,760
Give it to him now!

415
00:14:51,760 --> 00:14:52,520
Give it to him.

416
00:14:52,520 --> 00:14:53,040
Yeah.

417
00:14:53,040 --> 00:14:54,160
Give him the medicine.

418
00:14:54,400 --> 00:14:55,640
What is it?

419
00:14:55,640 --> 00:14:57,040
Give it to him.

420
00:14:58,000 --> 00:14:58,800
Is this for him?

421
00:14:58,800 --> 00:14:59,560
Yes, give it to him.

422
00:15:00,300 --> 00:15:04,140
(Is this the medicine
that can calm Li Attention down?)

423
00:15:04,480 --> 00:15:05,720
EMO Fly Away.

424
00:15:05,720 --> 00:15:06,120
Yes.

425
00:15:06,640 --> 00:15:09,080
(DLC Quest 1)
Congrats! You completed the quest.

426
00:15:09,080 --> 00:15:11,960
You have one chance
to verify ESC's identity.

427
00:15:11,960 --> 00:15:14,770
You can verify it when you return
to the game archive.

428
00:15:14,770 --> 00:15:17,710
Keep uncovering the secrets
hidden in this memory.

429
00:15:17,720 --> 00:15:18,880
(DLC Quest Complete)
We got our chance.

430
00:15:18,880 --> 00:15:19,420
(Gained one chance
to verify ESC's identity)

431
00:15:19,880 --> 00:15:20,880
Found it.

432
00:15:20,880 --> 00:15:22,000
EMO Fly Away.

433
00:15:22,000 --> 00:15:22,760
Where did you find it?

434
00:15:22,760 --> 00:15:23,320
Over there.

435
00:15:23,880 --> 00:15:24,800
Who checked that area earlier?

436
00:15:25,040 --> 00:15:25,960
He checked the couch.

437
00:15:26,760 --> 00:15:27,800
He's the first.

438
00:15:27,800 --> 00:15:28,840
I didn't see where it was.

439
00:15:29,240 --> 00:15:30,240
The countdown starts now.

440
00:15:31,300 --> 00:15:39,900
(Medicine bottle location)

441
00:15:40,600 --> 00:15:41,480
No need to explain.

442
00:15:41,960 --> 00:15:43,360
An explanation is just...

443
00:15:43,360 --> 00:15:44,360
An excuse!

444
00:15:44,360 --> 00:15:45,960
And what you're hiding

445
00:15:45,960 --> 00:15:47,380
is the truth!

446
00:15:47,500 --> 00:15:49,740
(Did He Da avoid
finding the right bottle?)

447
00:15:50,120 --> 00:15:51,480
What does it look like? Can I see it?

448
00:15:52,120 --> 00:15:55,240
There's another string
of numbers and letters.

449
00:15:55,780 --> 00:15:56,960
(What do the letters
on the medicine bottle mean?)

450
00:15:56,960 --> 00:15:57,600
Let's keep it for now.

451
00:16:01,000 --> 00:16:02,200
Who's here today?

452
00:16:03,720 --> 00:16:04,440
I'm here.

453
00:16:04,440 --> 00:16:05,000
Your friends.

454
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:05,840
All of your friends

455
00:16:05,840 --> 00:16:07,000
are here to see you.

456
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:08,720
You're all here.

457
00:16:09,480 --> 00:16:09,880
Good.

458
00:16:11,240 --> 00:16:11,760
Great.

459
00:16:12,180 --> 00:16:13,580
(Li Attention calms down
after taking the medicine)

460
00:16:13,600 --> 00:16:15,840
It's been sometime
since I felt this peaceful.

461
00:16:16,440 --> 00:16:17,040
Thank you all.

462
00:16:18,080 --> 00:16:18,960
Take a seat.

463
00:16:18,960 --> 00:16:19,880
Let's talk.

464
00:16:22,520 --> 00:16:23,760
What day is it today?

465
00:16:25,000 --> 00:16:26,400
It is...

466
00:16:26,400 --> 00:16:27,480
24 June.

467
00:16:28,480 --> 00:16:29,240
I don't think so.

468
00:16:29,860 --> 00:16:31,000
(It isn't 24 June today)

469
00:16:31,000 --> 00:16:33,880
I feel like it should be the day

470
00:16:33,880 --> 00:16:35,520
we were about to join the game.

471
00:16:35,980 --> 00:16:37,120
(The day they were about
to enter the game)

472
00:16:37,120 --> 00:16:38,760
It would be March.

473
00:16:38,760 --> 00:16:40,600
Before 9 March.

474
00:16:43,200 --> 00:16:44,600
Who said it was March?

475
00:16:44,600 --> 00:16:45,640
March.

476
00:16:46,080 --> 00:16:47,640
Then it should be 9 March today.

477
00:16:47,980 --> 00:16:50,420
(Today is 9 March)

478
00:16:51,400 --> 00:16:52,480
Did he die on this day?

479
00:16:52,480 --> 00:16:53,400
The day he died.

480
00:16:53,800 --> 00:16:55,360
(9 March, Li Attention saved everyone)
The day you saved us.

481
00:16:55,360 --> 00:16:56,120
(by sacrificing himself.)

482
00:16:56,120 --> 00:16:57,080
When we found the corpse.

483
00:16:57,640 --> 00:16:58,880
(Case report. Confirmed)
Body found on 9 March.

484
00:16:59,600 --> 00:17:01,480
Found a male body in a back alley.

485
00:17:02,220 --> 00:17:02,700
(Body found)

486
00:17:03,480 --> 00:17:04,520
It's almost the day

487
00:17:04,520 --> 00:17:05,720
(ESC memory fragment 1, Time: 9 March)

488
00:17:05,720 --> 00:17:07,880
(Location: Li Attention's home)
you all entered the Door of Truth game.

489
00:17:09,760 --> 00:17:10,640
I think

490
00:17:12,070 --> 00:17:13,240
the game world

491
00:17:13,880 --> 00:17:14,830
is beautiful.

492
00:17:15,480 --> 00:17:16,560
My friends,

493
00:17:16,560 --> 00:17:17,350
be ready

494
00:17:17,880 --> 00:17:19,480
to welcome a new life.

495
00:17:24,310 --> 00:17:25,560
A new world!

496
00:17:25,560 --> 00:17:26,830
(Dramatic use only. Do not imitate)

497
00:17:26,830 --> 00:17:27,310
Goodbye.

498
00:17:33,000 --> 00:17:34,080
(Li Attention killed himself on 9 March)
Li Attention!

499
00:17:34,080 --> 00:17:35,120
He jumped down.

500
00:17:35,120 --> 00:17:36,320
Someone jumped off a building!

501
00:17:39,960 --> 00:17:41,080
Ning 2K!

502
00:17:41,080 --> 00:17:41,480
Wait, no.

503
00:17:41,480 --> 00:17:42,200
(Too shocked to process it)

504
00:17:42,200 --> 00:17:42,960
Li Attention!

505
00:17:54,640 --> 00:17:57,480
He recreated his suicide attempt.

506
00:17:57,480 --> 00:17:58,480
(Back to the day Li killed himself)
The crime scene.

507
00:17:58,480 --> 00:17:59,000
The day itself.

508
00:18:00,320 --> 00:18:01,920
There's a possibility
that he committed suicide.

509
00:18:03,040 --> 00:18:05,320
He took the blame for our sins

510
00:18:05,320 --> 00:18:05,960
and killed himself.

511
00:18:05,960 --> 00:18:07,760
He even caused those injuries too.

512
00:18:09,280 --> 00:18:10,560
(Li Attention indeed killed himself)
9 March

513
00:18:10,560 --> 00:18:12,480
was the day he killed himself.

514
00:18:12,480 --> 00:18:12,960
Yes.

515
00:18:12,960 --> 00:18:13,320
Am I right?

516
00:18:13,320 --> 00:18:14,960
It was the last day on his plan.

517
00:18:16,080 --> 00:18:17,960
We even came to disturb him

518
00:18:17,960 --> 00:18:19,040
on his last day.

519
00:18:19,140 --> 00:18:20,780
(A belated regret)

520
00:18:21,080 --> 00:18:22,200
We gave him the medicine.

521
00:18:22,200 --> 00:18:23,320
We freed him.

522
00:18:24,080 --> 00:18:25,320
It's because he took the medicine.

523
00:18:25,320 --> 00:18:27,320
He could've stayed crazy
and lived for a long time.

524
00:18:27,320 --> 00:18:28,840
After taking the medicine
and calming down,

525
00:18:28,840 --> 00:18:29,560
he jumped down.

526
00:18:30,200 --> 00:18:31,200
Who gave him the medicine?

527
00:18:31,720 --> 00:18:32,440
Him.

528
00:18:33,040 --> 00:18:34,360
It's my fault now?

529
00:18:34,360 --> 00:18:36,440
You held him by the neck
and forced him to take it.

530
00:18:36,460 --> 00:18:40,140
(30% heartbroken, 100% wronged)

531
00:18:40,180 --> 00:18:41,700
(All his credit erased)

532
00:18:41,960 --> 00:18:43,600
Who told me to feed it to him?

533
00:18:44,280 --> 00:18:45,680
(Mastermind No. 1)
Give it to him.

534
00:18:45,680 --> 00:18:46,720
(Mastermind No. 2)
Take the pill!

535
00:18:46,720 --> 00:18:49,020
(Just following orders)
Give it to him!

536
00:18:49,240 --> 00:18:51,020
(Innocent)
No, it wasn't you.

537
00:18:51,060 --> 00:18:52,380
(Angry)

538
00:18:54,280 --> 00:18:55,800
ESC hid these three letters

539
00:18:55,800 --> 00:18:57,480
in his three secret spaces.

540
00:18:58,040 --> 00:18:58,840
The six of you

541
00:18:58,840 --> 00:19:00,880
need to go to the room together

542
00:19:00,880 --> 00:19:02,440
and find the secret.

543
00:19:03,440 --> 00:19:05,440
This is ESC's memory fragment.

544
00:19:05,440 --> 00:19:06,600
That bad guy.

545
00:19:06,600 --> 00:19:07,720
That bad guy come to his home

546
00:19:07,720 --> 00:19:08,600
on the day of his death.

547
00:19:08,600 --> 00:19:09,480
Wait, he didn't come.

548
00:19:09,480 --> 00:19:10,320
We were all here.

549
00:19:11,080 --> 00:19:13,600
(They were here when Li Attention died)
Actually, we all saw him

550
00:19:13,600 --> 00:19:15,320
jumped off the building

551
00:19:15,320 --> 00:19:16,560
to clear our names.

552
00:19:17,600 --> 00:19:20,080
So this scene is a memory

553
00:19:20,080 --> 00:19:21,560
shared by all of us.

554
00:19:22,100 --> 00:19:23,670
(They saw Li Attention's suicide)
We experienced it together.

