856
00:27:50,800 --> 00:27:51,160
Yes.

857
00:27:51,480 --> 00:27:52,520
They did more than they should have.

858
00:27:52,520 --> 00:27:53,000
They told...

859
00:27:53,000 --> 00:27:54,240
Killed a few civilians.

860
00:27:54,840 --> 00:27:56,520
And two days later,

861
00:27:56,520 --> 00:27:57,360
