He has depression.

932
00:29:52,600 --> 00:29:53,080
Maybe he said,

933
00:29:53,080 --> 00:29:54,760
"Give me some of your medicine."

934
00:29:54,760 --> 00:29:55,360
And I said,

935
00:29:55,840 --> 00:29:56,480
"No way."

936
00:29:56,480 --> 00:29:57,360
"If you don't, I'll be mad."

