(The alarm sounds. The first
assessment is about to begin)

1092
00:35:22,500 --> 00:35:24,020
(Nothing matters more than food)

1093
00:35:24,040 --> 00:35:26,200
It is now time for bed.

1094
00:35:26,200 --> 00:35:28,120
Room inspection will begin
in two minutes.

1095
00:35:28,600 --> 00:35:30,160
Patients, please ensure

1096
00:35:30,160 --> 00:35:32,640
that you're in the hospital-approved
sleeping position.

1097
00:35:32,960 --> 00:35:35,680
Only one person's head
may be visible on each bed.

1098
00:35:35,680 --> 00:35:36,940
(Only one head may be visible on each bed)
All four limbs

1099
00:35:36,940 --> 00:35:38,360
must remain covered by the blankets.

1100
00:35:38,360 --> 00:35:40,120
No third person is allowed,

1101
00:35:40,120 --> 00:35:41,280
and no one may be absent.

1102
00:35:41,280 --> 00:35:43,200
(Hands and ears both occupied)
If I find any violations,

1103
00:35:43,200 --> 00:35:44,440
one point will be deducted.

1104
00:35:44,440 --> 00:35:46,680
You will pass only if you
receive no more than two deductions.

1105
00:35:46,680 --> 00:35:49,280
(Fail if more than two points are deducted)
You have two attempts.

1106
00:35:49,280 --> 00:35:51,520
(Two attempts in total)
The countdown begins now.

1107
00:35:53,360 --> 00:35:54,600
The countdown has started.

1108
00:35:54,660 --> 00:35:56,140
(Putting down their bowls
and chopsticks to focus)

1109
00:35:56,160 --> 00:35:58,240
Can we combine these two beds?

1110
00:35:58,240 --> 00:35:59,120
No need to combine them.

1111
00:35:59,120 --> 00:36:00,440
The two of you can simply share one bed.

1112
00:36:00,440 --> 00:36:01,560
The four of us can share one bed.

1113
00:36:01,880 --> 00:36:02,880
All four of us?

1114
00:36:03,160 --> 00:36:04,800
How are we supposed to fit on this bed?

1115
00:36:04,800 --> 00:36:05,480
Stack ourselves.

1116
00:36:05,480 --> 00:36:06,000
It's fine.

1117
00:36:08,520 --> 00:36:09,480
Stack ourselves?

1118
00:36:09,960 --> 00:36:11,360
Side by side, I mean.

1119
00:36:11,360 --> 00:36:12,560
I understand.

1120
00:36:12,560 --> 00:36:13,080
(Confused)
All right.

1121
00:36:13,080 --> 00:36:13,800
Come on, hurry.

1122
00:36:13,800 --> 00:36:14,240
All right.

1123
00:36:15,300 --> 00:36:16,300
(Easily settling into position)

1124
00:36:16,380 --> 00:36:18,180
(Spectator section)

1125
00:36:19,160 --> 00:36:20,700
(The base)
Come on, crush me.

1126
00:36:20,920 --> 00:36:21,920
Crush you?

1127
00:36:22,120 --> 00:36:23,360
I'll take the far left.

1128
00:36:23,640 --> 00:36:24,600
Your feet...

1129
00:36:24,600 --> 00:36:26,040
Come over here.

1130
00:36:26,320 --> 00:36:27,560
Just sit on top of me.

1131
00:36:27,560 --> 00:36:28,400
We can all sit.

1132
00:36:28,460 --> 00:36:30,120
(Never have they slept
in such a crowded bed)

1133
00:36:30,120 --> 00:36:31,160
We need to split it evenly.

1134
00:36:31,160 --> 00:36:32,000
It's like...

1135
00:36:32,000 --> 00:36:32,520
All tilted.

1136
00:36:32,520 --> 00:36:33,840
This blanket isn't long enough.

1137
00:36:34,240 --> 00:36:35,480
You need to lie on top of us.

1138
00:36:36,500 --> 00:36:37,660
(An extremely awkward position)

1139
00:36:37,680 --> 00:36:39,640
I have to lie on top of you?

1140
00:36:39,640 --> 00:36:40,520
What is this?

1141
00:36:40,720 --> 00:36:41,280
You.

1142
00:36:41,960 --> 00:36:42,960
Or there won't be enough space.

1143
00:36:42,960 --> 00:36:44,120
Where else are we supposed to fit?

1144
00:36:44,120 --> 00:36:45,640
(Less than 0.5㎡ of space remaining)
Seriously, how do we get up there?

1145
00:36:45,640 --> 00:36:46,240
Not only...

1146
00:36:46,240 --> 00:36:47,060
(The entire space is already taken)

1147
00:36:49,260 --> 00:36:50,020
(The other two)

1148
00:36:50,040 --> 00:36:50,840
Just put your head here.

1149
00:36:50,840 --> 00:36:51,360
Yes, this works.

1150
00:36:51,360 --> 00:36:51,960
How do we get up?

1151
00:36:52,280 --> 00:36:53,160
How do we cover ourselves?

1152
00:36:53,180 --> 00:36:54,700
(Bury your head in the sand)

1153
00:36:56,400 --> 00:36:56,800
No.

1154
00:36:59,960 --> 00:37:01,680
Wait.

1155
00:37:01,680 --> 00:37:02,360
He, do it like this.

1156
00:37:02,360 --> 00:37:03,840
This blanket covers the lower half

1157
00:37:03,840 --> 00:37:04,680
(Covering the lower body)
and this one covers the upper half.

1158
00:37:04,680 --> 00:37:05,960
(Covering the lower body and upper body)
This one is too short.

1159
00:37:06,120 --> 00:37:07,240
There's another blanket here.

1160
00:37:07,240 --> 00:37:08,160
There's another one here.

1161
00:37:08,160 --> 00:37:09,000
Bring it over.

1162
00:37:09,000 --> 00:37:09,880
Ding, hurry and bring it.

1163
00:37:10,160 --> 00:37:10,640
Don't.

1164
00:37:11,080 --> 00:37:12,640
30 seconds remaining.

1165
00:37:13,240 --> 00:37:14,000
Hurry.

1166
00:37:14,000 --> 00:37:14,880
This one goes underneath.

1167
00:37:14,880 --> 00:37:15,400
It goes underneath.

1168
00:37:15,400 --> 00:37:16,040
Put your legs up.

1169
00:37:16,480 --> 00:37:17,400
Whose head should be visible?

1170
00:37:17,400 --> 00:37:18,080
Yours, I suppose.

1171
00:37:18,100 --> 00:37:20,180
(Both lie down)

1172
00:37:20,200 --> 00:37:20,800
Show your head.

1173
00:37:20,800 --> 00:37:21,920
You can tuck your legs in.

1174
00:37:21,920 --> 00:37:22,880
I'll tuck my legs in.

1175
00:37:22,880 --> 00:37:23,800
(Adjusting their positions)
Yes.

1176
00:37:24,320 --> 00:37:25,160
All right, I'll do this.

1177
00:37:25,640 --> 00:37:26,000
Okay.

1178
00:37:29,680 --> 00:37:30,160
Yes.

1179
00:37:31,000 --> 00:37:31,600
That's the idea.

1180
00:37:31,740 --> 00:37:34,180
(Cramped)

1181
00:37:35,820 --> 00:37:38,700
(This bed has been through enough)

1182
00:37:39,500 --> 00:37:41,660
(He Da, Ke Cutie, Ning 2K, Ding Dang)

1183
00:37:41,840 --> 00:37:43,020
(Exposed)
Hurry. Get your head in.

1184
00:37:43,480 --> 00:37:44,000
My leg.

1185
00:37:44,440 --> 00:37:45,750
(Emergency adjustment)
Countdown.

1186
00:37:45,760 --> 00:37:46,280
Ten.

1187
00:37:46,960 --> 00:37:47,560
Nine.

1188
00:37:48,080 --> 00:37:48,920
Eight.

1189
00:37:48,920 --> 00:37:49,960
Seven.

1190
00:37:49,960 --> 00:37:50,880
Six.

1191
00:37:50,880 --> 00:37:51,680
Five.

1192
00:37:51,680 --> 00:37:52,560
Four.

1193
00:37:52,560 --> 00:37:53,640
Three.

1194
00:37:53,640 --> 00:37:54,520
Two.

1195
00:37:54,520 --> 00:37:55,040
One.

1196
00:37:56,660 --> 00:38:00,180
(He Da, Ke Cutie, Ning 2K, Ding Dang)

1197
00:38:02,740 --> 00:38:04,100
(Immediately falling asleep)

1198
00:38:04,720 --> 00:38:05,880
Room inspection.

1199
00:38:07,120 --> 00:38:08,480
Let me take a closer look.

1200
00:38:09,780 --> 00:38:10,380
(No exposed limbs)

1201
00:38:11,620 --> 00:38:12,220
(Only one head visible)

1202
00:38:12,600 --> 00:38:13,520
Nothing out of place.

1203
00:38:15,080 --> 00:38:16,360
Lie still.

1204
00:38:16,760 --> 00:38:18,040
This side...

1205
00:38:18,520 --> 00:38:21,200
It's pretty crowded over here.

1206
00:38:21,300 --> 00:38:22,780
(Four people crammed onto one bed)

1207
00:38:24,820 --> 00:38:25,780
(Leg exposed, 1 point deducted)

1208
00:38:25,800 --> 00:38:27,240
Someone's limb is exposed.

1209
00:38:27,400 --> 00:38:28,480
All right. One point deducted.

1210
00:38:29,080 --> 00:38:29,440
Wait.

1211
00:38:30,320 --> 00:38:31,320
Cover it quickly.

1212
00:38:31,320 --> 00:38:32,040
No, the shoe...

1213
00:38:32,040 --> 00:38:33,600
Get the shoe under the blanket.

1214
00:38:33,800 --> 00:38:34,680
Then whose foot is that?

1215
00:38:34,680 --> 00:38:35,540
(Ding Dang's foot)

1216
00:38:36,120 --> 00:38:36,880
This is impossible.

1217
00:38:36,880 --> 00:38:37,640
Don't let it show.

1218
00:38:37,640 --> 00:38:38,800
I didn't cover myself properly.

1219
00:38:38,800 --> 00:38:40,160
Ke, hide your foot.

1220
00:38:40,160 --> 00:38:41,000
Are you doing this on purpose?

1221
00:38:41,000 --> 00:38:41,580
(Determined to find ESC)

1222
00:38:41,800 --> 00:38:42,920
I'm all the way on the left.

1223
00:38:44,320 --> 00:38:45,240
That's Ding.

1224
00:38:45,680 --> 00:38:47,320
There's no blanket over there.

1225
00:38:48,040 --> 00:38:49,360
How am I supposed to fit?

1226
00:38:49,520 --> 00:38:50,760
Wait. Where is your foot?

1227
00:38:50,760 --> 00:38:51,280
Where's your foot?

1228
00:38:51,280 --> 00:38:52,040
Here, right?

1229
00:38:52,680 --> 00:38:54,000
Lift it.

1230
00:38:54,000 --> 00:38:54,680
Yes, lift it.

1231
00:38:54,680 --> 00:38:56,040
Put your leg over me.

1232
00:38:56,280 --> 00:38:56,720
Wait, there's...

1233
00:38:56,720 --> 00:38:57,680
Your other leg's exposed.

1234
00:38:58,360 --> 00:38:59,000
All right.

1235
00:38:59,580 --> 00:39:00,380
(Hand exposed, 1 point deducted)

1236
00:39:00,380 --> 00:39:01,020
(A second head appears,
1 point deducted)

1237
00:39:01,480 --> 00:39:02,080
Points deducted.

1238
00:39:02,680 --> 00:39:02,920
Okay.

1239
00:39:02,920 --> 00:39:04,720
You have failed this round.

1240
00:39:05,080 --> 00:39:07,320
(First room inspection: Assessment failed)
The second inspection will begin shortly.

1241
00:39:07,560 --> 00:39:08,880
Ding, your foot was sticking out...

1242
00:39:08,880 --> 00:39:09,640
Lift it, Jin.

1243
00:39:09,640 --> 00:39:10,600
Your foot's been out the whole time.

1244
00:39:10,600 --> 00:39:11,600
Someone is interfering.

1245
00:39:11,920 --> 00:39:13,280
No, look at me.

1246
00:39:14,820 --> 00:39:15,660
(Their hips are practically off the bed)

1247
00:39:15,680 --> 00:39:17,480
Half my body is already
hanging off the bed.

1248
00:39:17,500 --> 00:39:19,060
(All that effort for nothing)

1249
00:39:20,060 --> 00:39:21,140
(Recharging)

1250
00:39:27,580 --> 00:39:28,420
(Assessment temporarily paused)

1251
00:39:28,540 --> 00:39:31,820
(I should recharge, too)

1252
00:39:34,200 --> 00:39:35,400
Let's talk this over again.

1253
00:39:35,680 --> 00:39:36,080
No.

1254
00:39:36,080 --> 00:39:37,160
(The ambitious 02-line members)
Get up.

1255
00:39:38,800 --> 00:39:39,960
Give us that.

1256
00:39:39,960 --> 00:39:40,920
The bedsheet.

1257
00:39:40,920 --> 00:39:42,480
(Using bedsheet as an additional blanket)
Take the bedsheet as well.

1258
00:39:42,680 --> 00:39:43,440
Okay. Just take it.

1259
00:39:43,440 --> 00:39:44,040
Okay.

1260
00:39:44,160 --> 00:39:45,200
I refuse to believe we can't do this.

1261
00:39:46,280 --> 00:39:46,560
Like this.

1262
00:39:46,560 --> 00:39:48,280
For the next round, one
of the men should move over

1263
00:39:48,280 --> 00:39:49,240
near your feet.

1264
00:39:49,640 --> 00:39:50,960
He can curl up there.

1265
00:39:50,960 --> 00:39:51,920
Yes. Like this.

1266
00:39:51,920 --> 00:39:53,000
Curl your legs up like this.

1267
00:39:53,060 --> 00:39:54,020
(Leaving some space underneath)

1268
00:39:54,120 --> 00:39:55,720
Then someone can sit underneath.

1269
00:39:55,720 --> 00:39:57,080
Maybe lean against her legs like this.

1270
00:39:57,080 --> 00:39:58,360
You can crouch down here.

1271
00:39:58,840 --> 00:39:59,480
That could work.

1272
00:40:00,000 --> 00:40:00,680
Let's try it.

1273
00:40:00,680 --> 00:40:02,080
How about the three of us try it first?

1274
00:40:02,440 --> 00:40:02,680
Come on.

1275
00:40:02,680 --> 00:40:03,200
I'll keep my head out.

1276
00:40:03,200 --> 00:40:03,780
(Emergency chewing)

1277
00:40:05,040 --> 00:40:07,320
The three of us can lie flat

1278
00:40:07,320 --> 00:40:08,640
and still fit on this bed.

1279
00:40:08,640 --> 00:40:09,040
Exactly.

1280
00:40:09,800 --> 00:40:11,280
This can cover all three of us.

1281
00:40:11,280 --> 00:40:12,560
(200% coverage)
This covers us just fine.

1282
00:40:12,800 --> 00:40:14,200
Right?

1283
00:40:14,200 --> 00:40:14,840
Yes. No problem.

1284
00:40:14,840 --> 00:40:15,480
Will this work?

1285
00:40:15,480 --> 00:40:15,960
No problem.

1286
00:40:15,960 --> 00:40:17,200
The countdown begins.

1287
00:40:19,040 --> 00:40:20,160
Cover us with several more blankets.

1288
00:40:20,160 --> 00:40:21,000
Add a few more blankets.

1289
00:40:21,000 --> 00:40:21,880
Okay.

1290
00:40:22,480 --> 00:40:23,320
Ning, more blankets over there.

1291
00:40:23,320 --> 00:40:23,880
Bring a few more.

1292
00:40:24,320 --> 00:40:25,120
All right.

1293
00:40:25,480 --> 00:40:26,280
Come on, get up here.

1294
00:40:26,280 --> 00:40:26,920
I'll handle it.

1295
00:40:28,080 --> 00:40:28,720
Move inward.

1296
00:40:29,360 --> 00:40:30,680
All right. Good.

1297
00:40:30,920 --> 00:40:31,280
Wait.

1298
00:40:31,280 --> 00:40:33,240
Ding's entire upper body is exposed.

1299
00:40:33,300 --> 00:40:34,740
(His entire back is exposed)
Turn sideways. Sideways.

1300
00:40:34,760 --> 00:40:36,000
I'm turning sideways. I am.

1301
00:40:36,000 --> 00:40:37,020
Turn this way.

1302
00:40:37,020 --> 00:40:37,580
I'll turn around.

1303
00:40:37,580 --> 00:40:38,140
My hips

1304
00:40:38,140 --> 00:40:39,180
will be sticking out.

1305
00:40:39,660 --> 00:40:41,460
(Things keep getting more complicated)

1306
00:40:41,560 --> 00:40:42,280
It's fine.

1307
00:40:42,600 --> 00:40:43,480
I'll position your heads.

1308
00:40:43,480 --> 00:40:44,600
Lean against my shoulders.

1309
00:40:44,920 --> 00:40:45,720
I'm settled.

1310
00:40:46,460 --> 00:40:48,020
(Crammed together)

1311
00:40:48,780 --> 00:40:50,860
(Leaning against his shoulders)

1312
00:40:50,880 --> 00:40:51,560
Like this.

1313
00:40:51,560 --> 00:40:52,160
Will this work?

1314
00:40:52,160 --> 00:40:53,040
Perfect.

1315
00:40:53,480 --> 00:40:54,240
That's enough.

1316
00:40:54,240 --> 00:40:54,600
Ning.

1317
00:40:55,040 --> 00:40:56,250
(Ke Cutie, Ding Dang, He Da)
You lie down. I'll stay underneath you.

1318
00:40:56,600 --> 00:40:57,960
We're all settled.

1319
00:40:57,960 --> 00:40:58,360
All right.

1320
00:41:01,840 --> 00:41:02,360
Wait a moment.

1321
00:41:02,360 --> 00:41:02,800
His

1322
00:41:02,800 --> 00:41:04,200
butt is exposed.

1323
00:41:04,400 --> 00:41:04,840
Move this way.

1324
00:41:04,840 --> 00:41:05,520
Move in a little more.

1325
00:41:05,520 --> 00:41:06,080
Further in.

1326
00:41:06,080 --> 00:41:06,400
Okay.

1327
00:41:06,400 --> 00:41:07,560
It's fine. Don't move anymore.

1328
00:41:07,560 --> 00:41:08,120
Hold still.

1329
00:41:08,480 --> 00:41:09,600
(Seal)
Look at my butt.

1330
00:41:09,600 --> 00:41:10,440
You can't.

1331
00:41:10,440 --> 00:41:11,840
Mine are showing too.

1332
00:41:11,840 --> 00:41:12,200
All right.

1333
00:41:12,880 --> 00:41:13,760
Don't move.

1334
00:41:13,940 --> 00:41:15,480
(Urgent)

1335
00:41:15,480 --> 00:41:16,320
Let me check again.

1336
00:41:16,320 --> 00:41:17,040
(Second confirmation)
Let me see who it is.

1337
00:41:17,040 --> 00:41:18,440
Let us see who gets caught later.

1338
00:41:18,440 --> 00:41:19,120
It's his fault.

1339
00:41:20,480 --> 00:41:21,640
Ning, I swear I won't move.

1340
00:41:21,640 --> 00:41:21,920
Okay.

1341
00:41:22,400 --> 00:41:23,880
Ning, make sure you are covered.

1342
00:41:24,920 --> 00:41:25,760
It's over. You found me.

1343
00:41:26,480 --> 00:41:27,160
You found me.

1344
00:41:27,800 --> 00:41:29,080
You two keep going. I'll keep watch.

1345
00:41:32,040 --> 00:41:33,560
Let me pull the back of your shirt down.

1346
00:41:33,560 --> 00:41:34,520
Okay, pull it down for me.

1347
00:41:35,800 --> 00:41:37,760
Ning, pull the left side
down a little more.

1348
00:41:37,760 --> 00:41:39,600
Ning, make the left
side a little longer.

1349
00:41:39,600 --> 00:41:40,280
Is this all right?

1350
00:41:40,280 --> 00:41:40,560
Yes.

1351
00:41:40,920 --> 00:41:41,400
All right.

1352
00:41:41,400 --> 00:41:41,880
The right?

1353
00:41:42,200 --> 00:41:43,040
It should be fine.

1354
00:41:43,040 --> 00:41:43,840
It's covered, Ning.

1355
00:41:43,840 --> 00:41:44,800
All right.

1356
00:41:44,800 --> 00:41:45,600
Don't move.

1357
00:41:45,960 --> 00:41:47,560
30 seconds left.

1358
00:41:49,160 --> 00:41:50,340
I can hardly breathe.

1359
00:41:50,340 --> 00:41:50,980
(Oxygen level in this area)

1360
00:41:51,440 --> 00:41:51,920
Catch your breath.

1361
00:41:56,620 --> 00:42:00,060
(Breathing restored)

1362
00:42:07,060 --> 00:42:09,700
(Let's rest for a moment)

1363
00:42:13,060 --> 00:42:14,060
(This ward is unusually lively)

1364
00:42:14,440 --> 00:42:15,000
I give up.

1365
00:42:19,780 --> 00:42:22,700
(The performance continues)

1366
00:42:22,720 --> 00:42:24,000
Countdown begins.

1367
00:42:24,000 --> 00:42:24,520
Ten.

1368
00:42:25,160 --> 00:42:25,840
Nine.

1369
00:42:26,280 --> 00:42:26,800
Eight.

1370
00:42:27,120 --> 00:42:28,320
- Move your butt in a little more.
- Seven.

1371
00:42:28,320 --> 00:42:29,800
- I'm squeezing in as far as I can.
- Six. Five.

1372
00:42:29,800 --> 00:42:30,280
Don't move.

1373
00:42:30,280 --> 00:42:30,860
Four.

1374
00:42:30,860 --> 00:42:31,760
Three.

1375
00:42:31,760 --> 00:42:32,720
Two.

1376
00:42:32,720 --> 00:42:33,640
One.

1377
00:42:34,560 --> 00:42:35,800
I'm here to make my rounds.

1378
00:42:36,560 --> 00:42:38,080
If she can see me, I'll eat my words.

1379
00:42:41,200 --> 00:42:42,720
What peculiar positions you’re all in.

1380
00:42:43,080 --> 00:42:44,560
How are you feeling?

1381
00:42:44,560 --> 00:42:45,760
Excellent.

1382
00:42:46,160 --> 00:42:47,280
What part of your body is this?

1383
00:42:47,280 --> 00:42:48,640
This is my abdomen.

1384
00:42:48,740 --> 00:42:50,460
(An intimidating belly)
Your abdomen?

1385
00:42:50,480 --> 00:42:50,920
Yes.

1386
00:42:50,920 --> 00:42:51,880
You've been eating quite well.

1387
00:42:52,280 --> 00:42:53,840
The meals have been good lately.

1388
00:42:53,840 --> 00:42:55,040
May I press down on it?

1389
00:42:55,040 --> 00:42:55,920
Preferably not.

1390
00:42:56,160 --> 00:42:57,160
Preferably not. All right.

1391
00:42:57,160 --> 00:42:58,120
Then what part is this?

1392
00:42:58,120 --> 00:42:59,320
This is my leg.

1393
00:42:59,320 --> 00:43:01,360
Your abdomen and legs
are remarkably close together.

1394
00:43:01,420 --> 00:43:02,020
(Abdomen, Leg)

1395
00:43:02,020 --> 00:43:03,520
(An impressive 70/30 figure)

1396
00:43:03,520 --> 00:43:04,840
Because my legs are short.

1397
00:43:04,840 --> 00:43:06,440
Short legs. All right.

1398
00:43:06,440 --> 00:43:07,680
You look beautiful.

1399
00:43:07,680 --> 00:43:08,720
I didn't expect such short legs.

1400
00:43:08,720 --> 00:43:09,320
Yes.

1401
00:43:11,280 --> 00:43:12,720
Are you experiencing any symptoms?

1402
00:43:13,360 --> 00:43:14,240
She's giving you medication.

1403
00:43:14,240 --> 00:43:14,760
She is...

1404
00:43:14,760 --> 00:43:15,880
She's giving you medication.

1405
00:43:15,880 --> 00:43:16,680
It hurts.

1406
00:43:16,960 --> 00:43:18,080
It hurts.

1407
00:43:18,340 --> 00:43:19,220
(Ah)

1408
00:43:20,580 --> 00:43:23,100
(Laughing to the point of suffering)

1409
00:43:23,120 --> 00:43:24,560
It hurts? Then I'll be gentler.

1410
00:43:25,040 --> 00:43:25,840
What about here?

1411
00:43:26,600 --> 00:43:27,760
It hurts here too.

1412
00:43:27,760 --> 00:43:28,160
This hurts?

1413
00:43:28,160 --> 00:43:29,160
Please be gentler.

1414
00:43:29,160 --> 00:43:30,120
If everything hurts,

1415
00:43:30,120 --> 00:43:31,600
I may have to treat you.

1416
00:43:34,560 --> 00:43:35,760
No.

1417
00:43:35,760 --> 00:43:37,920
Please be gentle with me.

1418
00:43:37,920 --> 00:43:39,200
Very well. Then what part is this?

1419
00:43:39,200 --> 00:43:40,840
This is my foot.

1420
00:43:41,040 --> 00:43:42,240
This is your foot?

1421
00:43:42,300 --> 00:43:43,620
(The thigh suddenly becomes the foot)

1422
00:43:43,920 --> 00:43:44,840
I believe so.

1423
00:43:45,160 --> 00:43:46,520
Then what was that just now?

1424
00:43:46,720 --> 00:43:47,840
Foot.

1425
00:43:47,840 --> 00:43:48,520
This is the foot.

1426
00:43:48,520 --> 00:43:49,560
This is also a foot?

1427
00:43:49,560 --> 00:43:51,000
Your feet are rather large.

1428
00:43:51,480 --> 00:43:51,880
Yes.

1429
00:43:51,880 --> 00:43:53,240
(No idea. My shoe size is unusual)
Anything else bothering you?

1430
00:43:53,240 --> 00:43:54,240
I'm fine.

1431
00:43:54,400 --> 00:43:54,920
You're fine.

1432
00:43:54,920 --> 00:43:55,400
Yes.

1433
00:43:55,640 --> 00:43:57,320
Then I'll examine this patient.

1434
00:43:57,640 --> 00:43:58,520
All right.

1435
00:44:00,240 --> 00:44:01,640
What part is this?

1436
00:44:01,880 --> 00:44:02,560
This is my hand.

1437
00:44:02,560 --> 00:44:03,320
This is your hand?

1438
00:44:03,720 --> 00:44:05,720
Your hands are rather plump.

1439
00:44:05,720 --> 00:44:06,960
Look. My hand is right here.

1440
00:44:07,320 --> 00:44:08,160
Very well.

1441
00:44:08,160 --> 00:44:09,000
Then what is this?

1442
00:44:09,440 --> 00:44:11,440
This is my waist.

1443
00:44:11,900 --> 00:44:14,140
(Ah)

1444
00:44:14,160 --> 00:44:14,600
Hand.

1445
00:44:15,040 --> 00:44:15,480
That tickles.

1446
00:44:16,040 --> 00:44:16,720
This is the waist.

1447
00:44:18,040 --> 00:44:18,680
It hurts again?

1448
00:44:19,160 --> 00:44:20,320
That injection hurt a little.

1449
00:44:20,320 --> 00:44:22,280
I barely pressed on it.

1450
00:44:22,340 --> 00:44:23,460
(Observing discreetly)

1451
00:44:23,560 --> 00:44:24,360
What part is this?

1452
00:44:24,360 --> 00:44:25,960
This is my abdomen.

1453
00:44:25,960 --> 00:44:27,440
You two certainly have been eating well.

1454
00:44:27,780 --> 00:44:28,860
(Matching large bellies)

1455
00:44:29,160 --> 00:44:30,320
We both love to eat.

1456
00:44:30,480 --> 00:44:31,700
(I can never give up food)
Indeed.

1457
00:44:32,200 --> 00:44:33,280
Then what part is this?

1458
00:44:33,840 --> 00:44:36,680
This is just below my navel.

1459
00:44:36,840 --> 00:44:37,680
It's still moving.

1460
00:44:37,680 --> 00:44:38,660
Something inside is dancing.

1461
00:44:38,780 --> 00:44:40,300
(The abdomen has a mind of its own)
Yes.

1462
00:44:41,800 --> 00:44:42,280
What part?

1463
00:44:42,280 --> 00:44:43,200
This is my thigh.

1464
00:44:43,200 --> 00:44:43,880
Your thigh?

1465
00:44:43,880 --> 00:44:44,720
(Thigh, Lower leg)
Then this is the lower leg.

1466
00:44:44,720 --> 00:44:45,240
Lower leg.

1467
00:44:45,240 --> 00:44:46,600
Your legs are pretty short too.

1468
00:44:46,600 --> 00:44:47,560
They are.

1469
00:44:48,260 --> 00:44:49,380
(Popping is contagious)

1470
00:44:49,800 --> 00:44:50,680
What part is this?

1471
00:44:50,820 --> 00:44:52,380
(Ah)

1472
00:44:52,400 --> 00:44:53,160
Foot.

1473
00:44:53,760 --> 00:44:54,880
Does your foot hurt this much?

1474
00:44:55,200 --> 00:44:55,960
Yes.

1475
00:44:56,440 --> 00:44:57,320
What are you doing?

1476
00:44:57,320 --> 00:44:58,120
It's extremely ticklish.

1477
00:45:00,700 --> 00:45:01,980
(Still highly sensitive to tickling)

1478
00:45:02,280 --> 00:45:04,240
You keep moving.
Is something bothering you?

1479
00:45:04,240 --> 00:45:06,000
It itches.

1480
00:45:06,000 --> 00:45:07,160
Itchy?

1481
00:45:07,160 --> 00:45:07,800
Does this itch too?

1482
00:45:07,800 --> 00:45:09,120
Yes.

1483
00:45:09,120 --> 00:45:10,320
All right.

1484
00:45:10,320 --> 00:45:12,120
Looks like you all did pretty well.

1485
00:45:12,520 --> 00:45:14,840
We'll count this round as a pass.

1486
00:45:15,460 --> 00:45:17,900
(Round 1 cleared)

1487
00:45:18,120 --> 00:45:19,240
Goodbye.

1488
00:45:22,320 --> 00:45:23,560
We're free.

1489
00:45:24,700 --> 00:45:25,940
(Breathing freely again)

1490
00:45:26,120 --> 00:45:27,080
She kept poking me here.

1491
00:45:27,180 --> 00:45:28,140
(Way too ticklish for this)

1492
00:45:29,200 --> 00:45:30,080
How was she poking you?

1493
00:45:30,080 --> 00:45:30,600
Like this.

1494
00:45:33,720 --> 00:45:34,720
Ning, you okay?

1495
00:45:34,720 --> 00:45:35,240
I'm fine.

1496
00:45:35,240 --> 00:45:35,880
Where'd she poke you?

1497
00:45:36,160 --> 00:45:37,160
I'm fine. She didn't.

1498
00:45:37,160 --> 00:45:38,000
She couldn't reach anywhere.

1499
00:45:38,000 --> 00:45:39,000
I had my legs tucked up.

1500
00:45:40,340 --> 00:45:42,020
(Went straight for my face)

1501
00:45:43,360 --> 00:45:44,320
Your hair...

1502
00:45:44,380 --> 00:45:46,780
(Frazzled puppy)
Does my hair still look okay?

1503
00:45:49,400 --> 00:45:50,080
What do they mean?

1504
00:45:51,380 --> 00:45:52,380
(Refueling comes first)

1505
00:45:52,880 --> 00:45:54,720
Attention, patients.

1506
00:45:54,720 --> 00:45:56,240
It's time
for Friendship and Support activity.

1507
00:45:56,520 --> 00:45:57,480
You must

1508
00:45:57,480 --> 00:45:59,600
(Round 2 is about to begin)
complete all the tasks

1509
00:45:59,600 --> 00:46:00,960
on the Friendship
and Support Recovery Plan.

1510
00:46:00,960 --> 00:46:02,800
The inspectors will arrive

1511
00:46:02,800 --> 00:46:04,560
in the ward in ten minutes.

1512
00:46:04,560 --> 00:46:06,000
Each task is worth two points.

1513
00:46:06,000 --> 00:46:07,560
There are 12 points total.

1514
00:46:07,560 --> 00:46:10,280
You need over six points to pass.

1515
00:46:10,280 --> 00:46:11,120
Over six points to pass.

1516
00:46:11,120 --> 00:46:13,000
(6 points or less means failure)
The plan's posted on your door.

1517
00:46:15,800 --> 00:46:17,400
Excuse me?

1518
00:46:17,500 --> 00:46:18,980
(What did Nan Do just see?)

1519
00:46:19,640 --> 00:46:21,480
You ate all the noodles!

1520
00:46:24,340 --> 00:46:25,620
(Help season each other's cold noodles)

1521
00:46:25,620 --> 00:46:26,700
(Then feed each other until finished)

1522
00:46:26,720 --> 00:46:27,760
You two!

1523
00:46:27,760 --> 00:46:28,360
Wait!

1524
00:46:31,140 --> 00:46:32,580
(Troublemaker on autopilot)

1525
00:46:32,760 --> 00:46:34,240
What do you mean?

1526
00:46:34,240 --> 00:46:35,840
You were wolfing down the noodles.

1527
00:46:35,840 --> 00:46:37,360
Quietly eating away.

1528
00:46:37,360 --> 00:46:38,360
Leave it. Just leave it.

1529
00:46:38,360 --> 00:46:39,120
Stop eating.

1530
00:46:39,960 --> 00:46:42,040
The two of you have to help

1531
00:46:42,040 --> 00:46:43,360
season each other's cold noodles.

1532
00:46:43,360 --> 00:46:45,520
We didn't season anything.
He ate it all!

1533
00:46:46,480 --> 00:46:47,400
You two do this one.

1534
00:46:47,400 --> 00:46:48,080
There are three pairs.

1535
00:46:48,080 --> 00:46:49,400
(Ning 2K & He Da are on noodle duty)
Yeah, we'll do the noodles.

1536
00:46:49,400 --> 00:46:51,160
Then help each other

1537
00:46:51,160 --> 00:46:52,040
eat the peanuts.

1538
00:46:52,040 --> 00:46:53,680
Let's do the peanuts.

1539
00:46:54,160 --> 00:46:55,600
You're terrible with chopsticks.

1540
00:46:55,600 --> 00:46:56,200
You'd better not.

1541
00:46:56,200 --> 00:46:57,840
I'm bad with chopsticks?

1542
00:46:58,080 --> 00:46:59,200
Remember the marbles?

1543
00:46:59,200 --> 00:47:00,520
You couldn't pick one up.

1544
00:47:01,200 --> 00:47:02,800
(See Episode 1 of Dungeon Unlocking)
I might not get a single one.

1545
00:47:03,280 --> 00:47:04,840
You really watched the show.

1546
00:47:04,840 --> 00:47:05,360
Of course.

1547
00:47:05,360 --> 00:47:06,440
You couldn't pick one up.

1548
00:47:06,680 --> 00:47:07,640
Help each other drink water.

1549
00:47:07,640 --> 00:47:08,360
We'll do the water.

1550
00:47:08,680 --> 00:47:09,960
The helper

1551
00:47:09,960 --> 00:47:11,680
must hold the very end of the spoon.

1552
00:47:11,680 --> 00:47:12,800
Do we have to drink one bowl

1553
00:47:12,800 --> 00:47:13,880
or two bowls of water?

1554
00:47:13,880 --> 00:47:14,600
One bowl.

1555
00:47:14,600 --> 00:47:16,240
One bowl is enough.

1556
00:47:16,240 --> 00:47:16,600
Okay.

1557
00:47:16,960 --> 00:47:18,240
Then we'll do the water.

1558
00:47:18,640 --> 00:47:20,340
(Drinking water)
You guys do the peanuts, okay?

1559
00:47:20,340 --> 00:47:21,040
(Eating peanuts)
Sure.

1560
00:47:21,040 --> 00:47:22,040
You two good with the peanuts?

1561
00:47:22,040 --> 00:47:22,760
Yeah, no problem.

1562
00:47:23,000 --> 00:47:23,800
How much time do we have?

1563
00:47:23,800 --> 00:47:24,960
What was the time limit again?

1564
00:47:25,240 --> 00:47:26,340
Within ten minutes.

1565
00:47:26,420 --> 00:47:28,220
(Complete all tasks within ten minutes)
Ten minutes.

1566
00:47:28,400 --> 00:47:29,960
That's plenty of time.

1567
00:47:30,880 --> 00:47:31,240
Shut up.

1568
00:47:32,080 --> 00:47:32,440
Zip it.

1569
00:47:32,440 --> 00:47:33,480
Don't say it's easy.

1570
00:47:33,480 --> 00:47:34,160
(Not saying another word)

1571
00:47:34,160 --> 00:47:34,920
Has it started?

1572
00:47:34,920 --> 00:47:35,320
Wait.

1573
00:47:35,320 --> 00:47:36,320
Let me take care of them first.

1574
00:47:36,600 --> 00:47:36,920
Come on.

1575
00:47:37,300 --> 00:47:38,260
(So obedient)

1576
00:47:38,480 --> 00:47:39,240
Easy. Just like that.

1577
00:47:43,700 --> 00:47:46,020
(Dad mode +1)

1578
00:47:46,440 --> 00:47:47,520
So this is how we feed you?

1579
00:47:47,960 --> 00:47:49,480
(The drinker must sit on the bed)
So we just feed each other normally?

1580
00:47:49,880 --> 00:47:51,000
Yeah. Normally is fine.

1581
00:47:51,000 --> 00:47:51,360
The two of us...

1582
00:47:51,380 --> 00:47:53,220
(Only half a bowl left)

1583
00:47:53,300 --> 00:47:54,980
(Everyone in position)

1584
00:47:56,080 --> 00:47:57,120
Feed me first. You go first.

1585
00:47:57,120 --> 00:47:57,940
(Ahh!)

1586
00:47:58,780 --> 00:47:59,880
(10-minute countdown begins)
No wonder...

1587
00:47:59,880 --> 00:48:01,200
(Night vision mode)
No wonder they gave us ten minutes.

1588
00:48:01,760 --> 00:48:02,040
I...

1589
00:48:02,040 --> 00:48:02,800
I'm speechless.

1590
00:48:03,240 --> 00:48:03,840
Nice!

1591
00:48:05,520 --> 00:48:06,720
This is impossible.

1592
00:48:07,320 --> 00:48:08,280
I can't pick it up.

1593
00:48:08,440 --> 00:48:08,720
This...

1594
00:48:09,760 --> 00:48:10,160
Babe,

1595
00:48:10,160 --> 00:48:10,680
this is too hard.

1596
00:48:10,680 --> 00:48:12,080
There's a light over there.

1597
00:48:12,080 --> 00:48:13,680
(Barely any light)
Okay, let's go there.

1598
00:48:15,040 --> 00:48:15,760
Okay.

1599
00:48:15,760 --> 00:48:16,480
That works.

1600
00:48:16,480 --> 00:48:17,440
Okay.

1601
00:48:18,400 --> 00:48:19,840
I can't pick it up. I'm doomed.

1602
00:48:19,840 --> 00:48:20,800
Don't do this on purpose.

1603
00:48:20,800 --> 00:48:21,720
(Suspicious)
I'm not! I really can't pick it up.

1604
00:48:21,720 --> 00:48:22,400
Are you doing it on purpose?

1605
00:48:22,400 --> 00:48:22,800
Okay, come on.

1606
00:48:24,240 --> 00:48:24,600
Here.

1607
00:48:24,600 --> 00:48:24,960
Can you see it?

1608
00:48:25,640 --> 00:48:25,840
Okay.

1609
00:48:25,840 --> 00:48:26,660
Find it yourself. I'll hold it here.

1610
00:48:26,660 --> 00:48:28,980
(A huge mouthful)

1611
00:48:29,200 --> 00:48:30,560
Okay, give me a bite. Come on.

1612
00:48:31,480 --> 00:48:31,800
Enough.

1613
00:48:32,240 --> 00:48:32,640
I...

1614
00:48:32,640 --> 00:48:35,740
(Even the nose gets a taste)

1615
00:48:37,300 --> 00:48:39,300
(Mouth at full capacity)

1616
00:48:39,320 --> 00:48:39,920
Tell me when you're done.

1617
00:48:41,000 --> 00:48:41,720
Good?

1618
00:48:41,720 --> 00:48:42,000
Done.

1619
00:48:42,480 --> 00:48:42,760
Okay.

1620
00:48:43,720 --> 00:48:45,280
I'll keep it right here.

1621
00:48:46,250 --> 00:48:47,810
(Like a pro)
This gives us the shortest distance.

1622
00:48:48,160 --> 00:48:48,760
Can you reach it?

1623
00:48:48,760 --> 00:48:49,200
Yeah.

1624
00:48:49,200 --> 00:48:49,600
Okay.

1625
00:48:49,600 --> 00:48:50,900
(Keeping up the pace)

1626
00:48:53,880 --> 00:48:54,400
Wait.

1627
00:48:58,200 --> 00:49:00,640
Bro, that's too much.

1628
00:49:00,640 --> 00:49:02,600
I'm going for speed.

1629
00:49:04,860 --> 00:49:07,540
(One spoonful at a time)

1630
00:49:09,120 --> 00:49:11,480
(Mouth can't keep up with hands)
Bro, can you let me finish one sip

1631
00:49:11,480 --> 00:49:12,440
before giving me another?

1632
00:49:16,800 --> 00:49:17,320
Wait.

1633
00:49:17,320 --> 00:49:19,160
Bro, stop making me laugh.

1634
00:49:19,160 --> 00:49:20,280
I can't pick them up anymore.

1635
00:49:20,280 --> 00:49:22,380
(Chopstick skills have their limits)

1636
00:49:22,400 --> 00:49:23,080
Where is it?

1637
00:49:23,440 --> 00:49:24,480
No, I put it over there.

1638
00:49:24,480 --> 00:49:26,280
You can get ready before you drink.

1639
00:49:26,920 --> 00:49:27,680
Okay, catch your breath.

1640
00:49:27,680 --> 00:49:28,280
We have ten minutes.

1641
00:49:28,280 --> 00:49:28,880
Here.

1642
00:49:28,880 --> 00:49:30,200
That's actually plenty of time.

1643
00:49:30,780 --> 00:49:32,700
(Spoon's too low)

1644
00:49:32,840 --> 00:49:34,400
Don't spit it all over me!

1645
00:49:34,680 --> 00:49:36,080
You're feeding my chin.

1646
00:49:36,080 --> 00:49:37,520
Can you aim for my mouth?

1647
00:49:37,680 --> 00:49:38,720
It's so dark.

1648
00:49:38,720 --> 00:49:39,800
How am I supposed to see?

1649
00:49:39,800 --> 00:49:41,160
Lift your bowl up. Okay.

1650
00:49:41,160 --> 00:49:43,100
(Searching by sight)

1651
00:49:48,580 --> 00:49:49,740
(Almost out of water)

1652
00:49:49,760 --> 00:49:50,360
Almost done.

1653
00:49:50,360 --> 00:49:51,160
Almost done, bro.

1654
00:49:51,160 --> 00:49:51,960
Almost there.

1655
00:49:52,360 --> 00:49:53,400
Just a little left.

1656
00:49:55,080 --> 00:49:56,320
That's enough water for today.

1657
00:49:56,320 --> 00:49:57,000
(Full from water alone)

1658
00:49:57,000 --> 00:49:58,120
Now I'm getting thirsty.

1659
00:49:58,120 --> 00:49:58,960
I want some too.

1660
00:50:01,000 --> 00:50:02,560
Three minutes left.

1661
00:50:02,840 --> 00:50:03,280
What?

1662
00:50:04,320 --> 00:50:05,000
Don't rush. It's okay.

1663
00:50:05,560 --> 00:50:06,520
We're almost done anyway.

1664
00:50:07,800 --> 00:50:08,680
Wait. Like this.

1665
00:50:09,680 --> 00:50:10,640
There's sauce. Careful.

1666
00:50:11,720 --> 00:50:12,240
It's okay.

1667
00:50:12,240 --> 00:50:12,960
Chew it yourself.

1668
00:50:12,960 --> 00:50:13,400
Lower.

1669
00:50:13,400 --> 00:50:13,960
We can go lower.

1670
00:50:13,960 --> 00:50:14,920
We don't have to stand so straight.

1671
00:50:15,400 --> 00:50:15,560
Yeah.

1672
00:50:17,000 --> 00:50:17,360
Okay.

1673
00:50:18,760 --> 00:50:19,560
Wait, there's a light over there.

1674
00:50:20,000 --> 00:50:20,880
Let's go by the light.

1675
00:50:21,160 --> 00:50:21,840
There's light here.

1676
00:50:23,880 --> 00:50:24,400
Alright.

1677
00:50:24,400 --> 00:50:25,200
There's barely any left.

1678
00:50:25,220 --> 00:50:26,240
(Just the bottom left)

1679
00:50:26,240 --> 00:50:26,960
I'll finish it all.

1680
00:50:26,960 --> 00:50:27,800
Okay, finish it.

1681
00:50:31,420 --> 00:50:32,660
(Choking)

1682
00:50:32,680 --> 00:50:33,200
It's okay.

1683
00:50:34,600 --> 00:50:35,200
Slow down.

1684
00:50:35,200 --> 00:50:36,240
Slurp slowly.

1685
00:50:36,480 --> 00:50:37,640
It's okay. Here.

1686
00:50:38,120 --> 00:50:38,880
I have this much left?

1687
00:50:38,900 --> 00:50:40,660
(Still almost half a bowl)

1688
00:50:40,680 --> 00:50:41,880
Did you give me extra?

1689
00:50:41,880 --> 00:50:42,720
No.

1690
00:50:44,200 --> 00:50:44,880
It's really not that much.

1691
00:50:45,160 --> 00:50:45,800
Just two bites left.

1692
00:50:46,680 --> 00:50:46,920
Here.

1693
00:50:49,020 --> 00:50:52,380
(Slurping at full speed)

1694
00:50:54,440 --> 00:50:54,760
Careful.

1695
00:50:54,760 --> 00:50:56,000
We'll have to pick that up later.

1696
00:50:56,400 --> 00:50:57,400
Or we'll lose points.

1697
00:50:58,400 --> 00:50:59,680
Yeah, she'll definitely deduct points.

1698
00:50:59,680 --> 00:51:00,680
(Strictly by the rules)
How are we supposed to find it?

1699
00:51:01,620 --> 00:51:02,860
(Drops it again)

1700
00:51:02,880 --> 00:51:03,240
We're doomed.

1701
00:51:09,800 --> 00:51:10,520
You guys are really enjoying that.

1702
00:51:10,520 --> 00:51:11,480
Looks so good.

1703
00:51:11,760 --> 00:51:12,880
I want noodles too.

1704
00:51:13,420 --> 00:51:14,940
Don't make me laugh.

1705
00:51:15,880 --> 00:51:16,800
Tastes good, huh?

1706
00:51:16,800 --> 00:51:18,040
(Master of mishearing)

1707
00:51:18,040 --> 00:51:19,480
One minute left.

1708
00:51:20,080 --> 00:51:20,760
Hurry!

1709
00:51:20,980 --> 00:51:21,580
(Current progress)

1710
00:51:21,580 --> 00:51:24,660
(Water team: 90%, Noodle team: 90%,
Peanut team: 80%)

1711
00:51:24,680 --> 00:51:25,240
No, I...

1712
00:51:25,240 --> 00:51:26,160
Wait, come over here.

1713
00:51:26,160 --> 00:51:26,800
Wait. Careful.

1714
00:51:27,480 --> 00:51:28,520
Let's take turns.

1715
00:51:28,520 --> 00:51:28,760
Okay.

1716
00:51:28,760 --> 00:51:29,280
Feed me first.

1717
00:51:30,080 --> 00:51:30,600
Then I'll feed you.

1718
00:51:31,720 --> 00:51:32,200
One more.

1719
00:51:35,360 --> 00:51:36,000
Okay, almost there.

1720
00:51:36,880 --> 00:51:37,200
All gone.

1721
00:51:37,600 --> 00:51:38,120
One more.

1722
00:51:45,000 --> 00:51:45,600
Okay.

1723
00:51:45,600 --> 00:51:45,980
Perfect.

1724
00:51:45,980 --> 00:51:46,740
(Noodle team completes the task)

1725
00:51:47,360 --> 00:51:48,080
That's all that's left?

1726
00:51:48,080 --> 00:51:48,600
Just this little bit.

1727
00:51:52,400 --> 00:51:53,400
I'll pour in the last bit.

1728
00:51:56,080 --> 00:51:56,800
We got it, bro.

1729
00:51:57,360 --> 00:51:58,440
Done!

1730
00:51:58,440 --> 00:52:01,820
(Water team completes the task)

1731
00:52:02,160 --> 00:52:02,600
Hurry!

1732
00:52:02,600 --> 00:52:03,860
(Only one team left)

1733
00:52:04,440 --> 00:52:05,360
This isn't easy either.

1734
00:52:05,360 --> 00:52:06,280
Hurry!

1735
00:52:07,120 --> 00:52:08,200
Just push them all in.

1736
00:52:08,200 --> 00:52:09,000
Don't do them one by one.

1737
00:52:09,000 --> 00:52:09,440
I am!

1738
00:52:09,440 --> 00:52:10,240
I'm pushing them in!

1739
00:52:12,040 --> 00:52:12,760
Okay.

1740
00:52:12,760 --> 00:52:13,440
There are still some on the floor.

1741
00:52:13,440 --> 00:52:14,800
(All tasks completed)

1742
00:52:14,800 --> 00:52:15,760
Guys, help me find them.

1743
00:52:15,760 --> 00:52:16,640
There are two on the floor.

1744
00:52:17,320 --> 00:52:18,480
Countdown.

1745
00:52:18,480 --> 00:52:19,080
Five.

1746
00:52:19,800 --> 00:52:20,800
Four.

1747
00:52:20,800 --> 00:52:21,680
Three.

1748
00:52:21,680 --> 00:52:22,600
Two.

1749
00:52:22,600 --> 00:52:23,120
One.

1750
00:52:24,760 --> 00:52:25,680
We did it perfectly.

1751
00:52:25,680 --> 00:52:27,160
Did you finish all the food?

1752
00:52:27,160 --> 00:52:28,880
Nobody move!

1753
00:52:29,840 --> 00:52:30,880
Jin.

1754
00:52:31,420 --> 00:52:32,620
(Peanuts all over the floor)

1755
00:52:33,520 --> 00:52:33,920
Quick.

1756
00:52:33,920 --> 00:52:36,100
Don't move!

1757
00:52:36,680 --> 00:52:38,120
Move, and you'll lose points.

1758
00:52:38,840 --> 00:52:39,240
Okay.

1759
00:52:39,240 --> 00:52:43,220
(Covering the evidence)

1760
00:52:45,860 --> 00:52:46,660
(Peanuts)

1761
00:52:46,680 --> 00:52:49,040
Peanuts. Minus two points.

1762
00:52:49,040 --> 00:52:50,360
(Peanuts not completely eaten)
Those aren't our peanuts!

1763
00:52:50,360 --> 00:52:52,080
How would our peanuts end up there?

1764
00:52:52,080 --> 00:52:52,560
Impossible.

1765
00:52:52,560 --> 00:52:53,800
Those can't be ours.

1766
00:52:55,280 --> 00:52:56,180
(Cold noodle portion is short)
That's another two points.

1767
00:52:57,240 --> 00:52:58,000
And...

1768
00:52:58,000 --> 00:52:59,560
(Leftover toppings)
You didn't add all the toppings.

1769
00:52:59,560 --> 00:53:00,940
(Toppings not completely eaten)
Minus two points.

1770
00:53:01,020 --> 00:53:03,060
(6 points deducted.
One more deduction means failure)

1771
00:53:03,080 --> 00:53:03,480
I...

1772
00:53:07,860 --> 00:53:10,140
(Emergency cleanup)

1773
00:53:11,000 --> 00:53:11,840
There are more peanuts here.

1774
00:53:11,840 --> 00:53:12,560
That many?

1775
00:53:12,740 --> 00:53:13,980
(Escaped peanuts)

1776
00:53:16,520 --> 00:53:17,720
Okay, let me check.

1777
00:53:18,900 --> 00:53:19,980
(Leftover water)

1778
00:53:20,280 --> 00:53:21,560
This bowl is finished,

1779
00:53:21,560 --> 00:53:23,080
but this one isn't.

1780
00:53:23,080 --> 00:53:24,160
(Water not completely finished)
That's another deduction.

1781
00:53:25,880 --> 00:53:27,480
We only had to drink one bowl.

1782
00:53:27,480 --> 00:53:28,360
That's not right.

1783
00:53:28,360 --> 00:53:29,240
Look at what it says.

1784
00:53:29,680 --> 00:53:30,920
Help each other drink water

1785
00:53:30,920 --> 00:53:32,120
and finish the whole bowl.

1786
00:53:32,120 --> 00:53:33,400
It doesn't say two whole bowls, right?

1787
00:53:33,560 --> 00:53:34,840
So you can't blame...

1788
00:53:34,840 --> 00:53:36,360
You can't blame us for that, right?

1789
00:53:36,640 --> 00:53:37,640
Help each other.

1790
00:53:37,640 --> 00:53:39,280
"Help each other" means

1791
00:53:39,280 --> 00:53:41,200
(Help each other drink one bowl each)
we help each other.

1792
00:53:41,440 --> 00:53:42,640
One bowl per person.

1793
00:53:43,400 --> 00:53:44,040
That's what it means.

1794
00:53:44,780 --> 00:53:46,300
(Doomed on all fronts)

1795
00:53:46,480 --> 00:53:48,800
Unfortunately, I have to tell you

1796
00:53:48,800 --> 00:53:51,040
that you failed this round.

1797
00:53:51,040 --> 00:53:51,800
(Round 2 failed)

1798
00:53:51,800 --> 00:53:52,840
I'll be going, then.

1799
00:53:52,840 --> 00:53:54,080
Unfortunately,

1800
00:53:54,080 --> 00:53:55,560
you failed to complete the tasks in time

1801
00:53:56,040 --> 00:53:58,960
and lost the chance
to verify ESC's identity.

1802
00:53:58,960 --> 00:54:01,840
Please continue uncovering
the secrets hidden in this memory.

1803
00:54:01,860 --> 00:54:02,780
(Treatment Ward DLC mission failed)

1804
00:54:02,780 --> 00:54:03,820
(Failed to earn a chance
to verify ESC's identity)

1805
00:54:03,840 --> 00:54:05,600
Why did you start eating noodles
the second you came in?

1806
00:54:05,920 --> 00:54:06,280
Exactly.

1807
00:54:06,280 --> 00:54:08,280
Why did you guys immediately
start eating noodles?

1808
00:54:08,280 --> 00:54:10,280
You two were eating like crazy.

1809
00:54:10,280 --> 00:54:11,800
You'd already had

1810
00:54:11,800 --> 00:54:14,480
so much crispy beef, fruit,
and tangerines there.

1811
00:54:14,480 --> 00:54:16,000
Worked up an appetite, huh?

1812
00:54:16,280 --> 00:54:18,680
But Ning and I did the best.

1813
00:54:19,080 --> 00:54:20,500
(Then explain this)
What about these?

1814
00:54:20,600 --> 00:54:21,320
No.

1815
00:54:21,320 --> 00:54:22,880
We usually eat our noodles plain.

1816
00:54:22,880 --> 00:54:24,920
Who knew we had to add every topping?

1817
00:54:24,920 --> 00:54:26,240
Might as well eat the bowl too!

1818
00:54:29,080 --> 00:54:30,640
We were totally framed.

1819
00:54:30,640 --> 00:54:32,080
There was nothing we could do.

1820
00:54:32,800 --> 00:54:34,080
And we even asked.

1821
00:54:34,080 --> 00:54:34,440
Right.

1822
00:54:34,440 --> 00:54:34,960
Ning.

1823
00:54:35,560 --> 00:54:36,480
Definitely Ning.

1824
00:54:36,480 --> 00:54:37,740
(Prime suspect)

1825
00:54:38,040 --> 00:54:39,600
I think those two
are the most suspicious.

1826
00:54:39,800 --> 00:54:40,120
Me?

1827
00:54:40,800 --> 00:54:42,360
(Exhausted. Silent. Defeated. Hopeless.)
Can you back us up?

1828
00:54:42,840 --> 00:54:44,160
I asked right here,

1829
00:54:44,160 --> 00:54:45,320
"Do we need to drink the other bowl?"

1830
00:54:45,320 --> 00:54:46,320
Ning himself said,

1831
00:54:46,320 --> 00:54:47,520
"No. One bowl is enough."

1832
00:54:47,520 --> 00:54:49,640
Right. We specifically checked.

1833
00:54:49,640 --> 00:54:50,760
Do we have to drink one bowl

1834
00:54:50,760 --> 00:54:51,840
or two bowls of water?

1835
00:54:51,840 --> 00:54:52,480
One bowl.

1836
00:54:52,480 --> 00:54:54,040
One bowl is enough.

1837
00:54:54,100 --> 00:54:55,540
(Too defeated to argue)

1838
00:54:57,240 --> 00:54:58,960
But the second you two came in,

1839
00:54:58,960 --> 00:55:00,840
you rushed straight for those noodles.

1840
00:55:00,840 --> 00:55:01,680
No.

1841
00:55:01,680 --> 00:55:02,280
Who knew?

1842
00:55:03,400 --> 00:55:05,120
(Noodle lover couldn't resist)
I do love noodles. That's true.

1843
00:55:05,160 --> 00:55:06,320
I think Ding is a little...

1844
00:55:06,320 --> 00:55:07,560
You really might be a little suspicious.

1845
00:55:07,620 --> 00:55:08,080
(Me again?)

1846
00:55:08,080 --> 00:55:08,880
What did I do?

1847
00:55:08,880 --> 00:55:09,640
What did I even do?

1848
00:55:09,640 --> 00:55:11,080
That's because in the first round,

1849
00:55:11,080 --> 00:55:12,080
we kept telling you to move your leg,

1850
00:55:12,080 --> 00:55:13,160
but you wouldn't move it.

1851
00:55:14,000 --> 00:55:14,600
In the first round,

1852
00:55:14,600 --> 00:55:15,560
there were four people on this side.

1853
00:55:16,280 --> 00:55:17,760
I only had half the bed.

1854
00:55:17,760 --> 00:55:20,280
(Poor Ding)
Half my body was hanging off.

1855
00:55:20,280 --> 00:55:21,840
The fact that I didn't fall off

1856
00:55:22,080 --> 00:55:23,600
was already impressive.

1857
00:55:28,440 --> 00:55:30,040
And you're still questioning me?

1858
00:55:30,040 --> 00:55:32,880
(Not cool)
And we only had one of these.

1859
00:55:34,520 --> 00:55:35,160
Ding was...

1860
00:55:35,160 --> 00:55:37,160
Ding was really trying
to complete the task.

1861
00:55:38,920 --> 00:55:39,280
No.

1862
00:55:39,960 --> 00:55:41,080
No, I still have

1863
00:55:41,080 --> 00:55:41,920
to defend myself here.

1864
00:55:41,920 --> 00:55:44,400
How was I supposed to know
the noodles were a prop?

1865
00:55:44,400 --> 00:55:44,840
No.

1866
00:55:44,840 --> 00:55:46,200
Normally, when they give us food,

1867
00:55:46,200 --> 00:55:47,600
there's enough for all six of us.

1868
00:55:47,920 --> 00:55:49,400
(Solid reasoning)
I knew right away that wasn't it.

1869
00:55:49,400 --> 00:55:50,800
It had to be part of this room.

1870
00:55:50,800 --> 00:55:51,160
But...

1871
00:55:51,160 --> 00:55:52,880
I can understand why Ning ate it.

1872
00:55:52,880 --> 00:55:55,160
But you joining in was suspicious.

1873
00:55:55,160 --> 00:55:57,000
(Still suspicious)
You were eating like crazy.

1874
00:55:57,000 --> 00:55:57,800
Here's the thing.

1875
00:55:57,800 --> 00:55:58,440
There's no need to accuse anyone.

1876
00:55:58,440 --> 00:55:59,160
It doesn't help.

1877
00:55:59,160 --> 00:56:00,480
Because once you do that,

1878
00:56:00,480 --> 00:56:01,280
once you start accusing others,

1879
00:56:01,280 --> 00:56:02,720
you only look more suspicious.

1880
00:56:02,720 --> 00:56:04,360
First of all, none of us knew

1881
00:56:04,360 --> 00:56:05,280
what today's mission would be.

1882
00:56:05,520 --> 00:56:06,120
Exactly.

1883
00:56:06,600 --> 00:56:08,160
But what if ESC knew?

1884
00:56:08,220 --> 00:56:09,000
(ESC may remember the ward's rules)

1885
00:56:09,000 --> 00:56:09,320
Well...

1886
00:56:09,320 --> 00:56:10,280
Analyzing it from that angle

1887
00:56:10,280 --> 00:56:11,000
doesn't mean anything.

1888
00:56:11,480 --> 00:56:12,360
You keep accusing everyone.

1889
00:56:12,360 --> 00:56:13,360
You're looking pretty suspicious now.

1890
00:56:14,300 --> 00:56:15,300
(You're suspicious too)

1891
00:56:15,600 --> 00:56:16,240
Fine. Whatever.

1892
00:56:16,240 --> 00:56:17,320
I say we check you first.

1893
00:56:18,240 --> 00:56:19,600
Sure, you can check me.

1894
00:56:19,600 --> 00:56:20,560
Can we check now?

1895
00:56:20,800 --> 00:56:21,440
No.

1896
00:56:21,440 --> 00:56:23,320
We have to return to the game lobby.

1897
00:56:23,320 --> 00:56:24,800
What's that box for?

1898
00:56:25,400 --> 00:56:28,320
Say the suspicious person's name
to open it.

1899
00:56:28,720 --> 00:56:29,840
The suspicious person's name?

1900
00:56:30,480 --> 00:56:30,920
What does that mean?

1901
00:56:30,920 --> 00:56:32,000
It wants us to say

1902
00:56:32,000 --> 00:56:32,720
who's infected

1903
00:56:32,720 --> 00:56:33,840
or who ESC is, right?

1904
00:56:33,940 --> 00:56:34,980
("Suspicious person" means ESC)

1905
00:56:35,200 --> 00:56:36,960
Or is it some kind of word puzzle?

1906
00:56:36,980 --> 00:56:38,400
(A word puzzle?)

1907
00:56:38,400 --> 00:56:40,000
The suspicious person's name.

1908
00:56:40,000 --> 00:56:40,820
(What does that mean?)

1909
00:56:41,200 --> 00:56:41,560
No.

1910
00:56:41,560 --> 00:56:43,240
Don't magic spells
sometimes work like that?

1911
00:56:43,680 --> 00:56:45,080
The suspicious person's name.

1912
00:56:45,080 --> 00:56:46,820
(Say the literal phrase?)

1913
00:56:48,400 --> 00:56:49,040
I got it!

1914
00:56:49,640 --> 00:56:50,320
Now I get it.

1915
00:56:50,380 --> 00:56:51,340
(Finally gets the joke)

1916
00:56:51,560 --> 00:56:51,800
Say

1917
00:56:52,240 --> 00:56:53,440
"the suspicious person's name".

1918
00:56:53,920 --> 00:56:54,400
I said it.

1919
00:56:54,400 --> 00:56:57,840
"The suspicious person".

1920
00:57:04,440 --> 00:57:06,240
Attention, patients.

1921
00:57:06,240 --> 00:57:08,200
(Round 3 is about to begin)
It's time for your physical assessment.

1922
00:57:08,220 --> 00:57:10,260
(All assessments must be completed
to unlock more memories)

1923
00:57:10,880 --> 00:57:12,080
For your safety,

1924
00:57:12,080 --> 00:57:13,800
please make sure

1925
00:57:13,800 --> 00:57:16,040
you stay as close as possible

1926
00:57:16,040 --> 00:57:17,040
to the cabinet at the back.

1927
00:57:17,040 --> 00:57:17,800
Why?

1928
00:57:17,800 --> 00:57:19,080
Why do we have to lean on it?

1929
00:57:19,360 --> 00:57:19,880
Here.

1930
00:57:20,120 --> 00:57:20,880
Over here.

1931
00:57:21,120 --> 00:57:21,600
Come on.

1932
00:57:21,600 --> 00:57:22,560
It's okay.

1933
00:57:22,560 --> 00:57:23,320
What's going on?

1934
00:57:24,560 --> 00:57:27,400
This patient is one of our finest

1935
00:57:27,400 --> 00:57:28,960
model patients.

1936
00:57:29,240 --> 00:57:31,240
Since coming here for treatment,

1937
00:57:31,240 --> 00:57:34,560
she's been cheerful and full of energy.

1938
00:57:34,720 --> 00:57:36,200
She'll demonstrate

1939
00:57:36,200 --> 00:57:39,000
how to ace this physical assessment.

1940
00:57:39,360 --> 00:57:39,880
Okay.

1941
00:57:43,040 --> 00:57:43,720
She's drawing a line.

1942
00:57:44,320 --> 00:57:45,360
Bro, what's that for?

1943
00:57:45,460 --> 00:57:47,120
(What's the line for?)

1944
00:57:47,120 --> 00:57:48,280
Don't tell me we have to hula-hoop

1945
00:57:48,280 --> 00:57:49,640
all the way from there to here.

1946
00:57:53,040 --> 00:57:53,960
Start and finish.

1947
00:57:54,480 --> 00:57:55,800
I can't even do one spin.

1948
00:57:56,240 --> 00:57:57,240
Neither can I.

1949
00:57:57,240 --> 00:57:57,900
(Skill not unlocked)

1950
00:57:58,120 --> 00:57:59,040
Can you do it?

1951
00:57:59,040 --> 00:58:00,400
I think I can do a little.

1952
00:58:00,400 --> 00:58:01,000
Great!

1953
00:58:01,960 --> 00:58:05,120
Before bed, embrace the moon

1954
00:58:05,180 --> 00:58:08,360
(What is she doing?)
and fill your body with moonlight.

1955
00:58:09,040 --> 00:58:10,200
Full of positive energy.

1956
00:58:10,760 --> 00:58:12,520
Everyone, say it with me.

1957
00:58:12,520 --> 00:58:13,520
I can do it!

1958
00:58:13,520 --> 00:58:15,040
(Joins right in)
I can do it!

1959
00:58:15,320 --> 00:58:17,880
I am worthy!

1960
00:58:18,760 --> 00:58:19,920
Today will be better!

1961
00:58:20,360 --> 00:58:21,760
Today will be better!

1962
00:58:23,360 --> 00:58:23,760
Go ahead.

1963
00:58:24,760 --> 00:58:26,040
Then what?

1964
00:58:32,220 --> 00:58:33,220
(Turns around)

1965
00:58:33,560 --> 00:58:34,360
She has to come back too?

1966
00:58:37,400 --> 00:58:38,800
Okay, please return to the ward.

1967
00:58:41,920 --> 00:58:44,720
Your next physical assessment is

1968
00:58:44,720 --> 00:58:46,160
a hula-hoop relay.

1969
00:58:46,160 --> 00:58:47,760
Five of the six of you

1970
00:58:47,760 --> 00:58:50,080
will take part in the relay.

1971
00:58:50,400 --> 00:58:51,760
(Five-person hula-hoop relay)
The remaining person

1972
00:58:51,760 --> 00:58:52,760
will cheer you on from the side.

1973
00:58:53,040 --> 00:58:53,980
(One person cheers from the side)
No problem.

1974
00:58:54,000 --> 00:58:56,240
(Start / Finish)
Go from the start to the finish and back

1975
00:58:56,240 --> 00:58:58,060
while continuously hula-hooping.

1976
00:58:58,180 --> 00:58:59,100
(Relay to the finish and back)
Okay.

1977
00:58:59,120 --> 00:59:01,800
You must finish within 90 seconds.

1978
00:59:02,040 --> 00:59:03,880
(90-second limit)
Ninety seconds for five people.

1979
00:59:03,880 --> 00:59:06,200
That's a little over ten seconds each.

1980
00:59:06,200 --> 00:59:07,080
Not bad.

1981
00:59:07,080 --> 00:59:08,140
(18 seconds each on average)

1982
00:59:08,480 --> 00:59:09,880
Can we try it first?

1983
00:59:09,880 --> 00:59:10,680
Sure.

1984
00:59:11,160 --> 00:59:12,440
How do you walk and hoop at once?

1985
00:59:13,500 --> 00:59:15,040
(Dropped before even starting)
This is impossible.

1986
00:59:15,040 --> 00:59:16,120
Here, let me try.

1987
00:59:16,120 --> 00:59:17,210
(Eager to try)
I want to...

1988
00:59:17,240 --> 00:59:18,160
Let me get a feel for it.

1989
00:59:18,160 --> 00:59:19,480
Watch your hand.

1990
00:59:19,500 --> 00:59:20,680
(Giving it a try)

1991
00:59:20,680 --> 00:59:21,240
Wait.

1992
00:59:21,240 --> 00:59:22,040
Don't.

1993
00:59:22,240 --> 00:59:23,240
Ding, you can cheer.

1994
00:59:23,520 --> 00:59:24,080
I'm cheering?

1995
00:59:25,500 --> 00:59:26,780
(Effortless)

1996
00:59:26,920 --> 00:59:27,760
No, he has to do it.

1997
00:59:28,200 --> 00:59:28,720
He has to.

1998
00:59:29,160 --> 00:59:29,520
I have to...

1999
00:59:29,520 --> 00:59:30,720
I shouldn't do it.

2000
00:59:31,200 --> 00:59:32,960
I'll take too much time.

2001
00:59:32,980 --> 00:59:34,660
(Sits out to save time)

2002
00:59:39,000 --> 00:59:40,000
You can do this.

2003
00:59:41,040 --> 00:59:41,520
This is...

2004
00:59:42,280 --> 00:59:42,880
Go back.

2005
00:59:42,880 --> 00:59:44,040
Keep it spinning and walk.

2006
00:59:44,900 --> 00:59:47,860
(Hidden skill unlocked)

2007
00:59:47,880 --> 00:59:48,720
Not bad.

2008
00:59:49,520 --> 00:59:50,360
That works.

2009
00:59:50,880 --> 00:59:51,320
My turn.

2010
00:59:55,120 --> 00:59:57,240
Spin the hoop, not yourself.

2011
00:59:58,320 --> 01:00:00,040
I'm taking off my heels.

2012
01:00:00,140 --> 01:00:01,060
(Going all in)

2013
01:00:01,160 --> 01:00:01,960
Down a level.

2014
01:00:02,760 --> 01:00:03,600
Going barefoot?

2015
01:00:03,600 --> 01:00:04,080
Seriously?

2016
01:00:04,460 --> 01:00:05,740
(Competitive mode: ON)

2017
01:00:07,080 --> 01:00:07,760
You're so cute.

2018
01:00:07,760 --> 01:00:09,040
I can't with you.

2019
01:00:09,040 --> 01:00:10,460
(Determined to win)

2020
01:00:12,320 --> 01:00:13,680
Can I give it a try?

2021
01:00:13,680 --> 01:00:14,480
If you can't do it,

2022
01:00:14,480 --> 01:00:17,120
let another student try.

2023
01:00:17,720 --> 01:00:18,880
What's with that look?

2024
01:00:19,320 --> 01:00:20,800
Where'd you get those slippers?

2025
01:00:21,000 --> 01:00:22,040
What even is this?

2026
01:00:22,600 --> 01:00:24,400
You look like a hula hoop yourself.

2027
01:00:24,640 --> 01:00:25,520
Basic on top,

2028
01:00:25,520 --> 01:00:26,480
not so basic on the bottom.

2029
01:00:27,180 --> 01:00:27,700
(French-style veil)

2030
01:00:27,700 --> 01:00:28,400
(Mismatched house slippers)

2031
01:00:28,400 --> 01:00:29,120
Wait.

2032
01:00:29,120 --> 01:00:29,740
(Chaotic, but make it fashion)

2033
01:00:32,120 --> 01:00:32,720
Don't laugh.

2034
01:00:32,720 --> 01:00:34,280
You won't pass the second round either.

2035
01:00:34,280 --> 01:00:35,360
Okay.

2036
01:00:39,080 --> 01:00:39,960
Not bad.

2037
01:00:39,960 --> 01:00:41,480
Go!

2038
01:00:41,800 --> 01:00:43,360
I got it.

2039
01:00:49,480 --> 01:00:50,440
Let's just do it like this.

2040
01:00:51,600 --> 01:00:52,120
Okay.

2041
01:00:52,120 --> 01:00:52,960
I'm dying!

2042
01:00:54,320 --> 01:00:55,320
Ning, give it a try.

2043
01:00:55,320 --> 01:00:56,360
I can't do it.

2044
01:00:56,360 --> 01:00:57,280
I don't know how to hula-hoop.

2045
01:00:57,280 --> 01:00:58,840
Move more front to back.

2046
01:00:59,200 --> 01:00:59,560
What do you mean?

2047
01:01:00,080 --> 01:01:01,160
More front to back.

2048
01:01:01,360 --> 01:01:01,720
Yeah.

2049
01:01:01,720 --> 01:01:02,080
That's it.

2050
01:01:03,020 --> 01:01:04,540
(Moving with all his might)

2051
01:01:04,800 --> 01:01:05,720
No, that's not.

2052
01:01:05,720 --> 01:01:06,520
What are you doing?

2053
01:01:06,520 --> 01:01:07,860
(Is that really how you taught him?)

2054
01:01:10,360 --> 01:01:11,680
That's not how it works.

2055
01:01:11,680 --> 01:01:12,880
Yes, it is.

2056
01:01:13,360 --> 01:01:15,200
You have to follow its momentum.

2057
01:01:15,380 --> 01:01:17,180
(Fast learner)

2058
01:01:18,360 --> 01:01:19,160
Just move a little like this.

2059
01:01:19,160 --> 01:01:20,440
Just a little.

2060
01:01:20,440 --> 01:01:21,080
Let's do it.

2061
01:01:21,620 --> 01:01:22,700
(Getting serious)
Let's go.

2062
01:01:22,960 --> 01:01:23,960
You two who are good at it go first.

2063
01:01:23,960 --> 01:01:24,400
I'll go first.

2064
01:01:24,400 --> 01:01:25,640
Okay, you got this!

2065
01:01:25,640 --> 01:01:26,320
- Positive energy!
- You got this!

2066
01:01:26,320 --> 01:01:27,240
You got this!

2067
01:01:27,240 --> 01:01:27,600
Positive energy!

2068
01:01:27,600 --> 01:01:28,410
You got this!

2069
01:01:28,410 --> 01:01:29,040
Positive energy!

2070
01:01:29,040 --> 01:01:29,620
You got this!

2071
01:01:29,620 --> 01:01:30,360
- You got this!
- Positive energy!

2072
01:01:30,660 --> 01:01:32,320
(Round 3 officially begins)
Positive energy!

2073
01:01:32,320 --> 01:01:33,440
Positive energy!

2074
01:01:33,440 --> 01:01:34,740
(Racing ahead)

2075
01:01:35,980 --> 01:01:37,420
(As expected, he's no ordinary person)

2076
01:01:41,440 --> 01:01:43,200
I feel like you're about to take off.

2077
01:01:43,200 --> 01:01:44,760
You look like a helicopter.

2078
01:01:44,760 --> 01:01:45,980
(Whoosh, and he's already gone)

2079
01:01:46,020 --> 01:01:47,580
(What about Ke?)
I can't do it.

2080
01:01:47,920 --> 01:01:49,120
(Bro has a tip for you)
Just run. Run straight across.

2081
01:01:49,740 --> 01:01:51,420
(Speed is the key)

2082
01:01:51,440 --> 01:01:52,640
Just don't fall.

2083
01:01:55,100 --> 01:01:56,700
(Those long legs.
Three steps and he's done)

2084
01:01:56,720 --> 01:01:57,680
Nan, hurry!

2085
01:01:57,680 --> 01:01:59,700
Hurry!

2086
01:01:59,700 --> 01:02:01,120
(I'm going!)

2087
01:02:01,120 --> 01:02:02,000
Go!

2088
01:02:03,260 --> 01:02:04,740
Ahhhh!

2089
01:02:04,760 --> 01:02:05,360
Yeah.

2090
01:02:05,360 --> 01:02:06,400
The bed!

2091
01:02:06,400 --> 01:02:07,020
(Successfully dodged the obstacle)

2092
01:02:07,740 --> 01:02:08,980
Ahhhhh!

2093
01:02:08,980 --> 01:02:10,420
Ow!

2094
01:02:10,540 --> 01:02:11,280
Ahhhhh!

2095
01:02:11,280 --> 01:02:12,240
Hurry!

2096
01:02:12,240 --> 01:02:14,760
Come on!

2097
01:02:14,760 --> 01:02:15,800
Wait, my veil!

2098
01:02:15,800 --> 01:02:16,840
(What is this look?)

2099
01:02:16,840 --> 01:02:18,320
This...

2100
01:02:18,320 --> 01:02:21,240
Come on, positive energy!

2101
01:02:22,040 --> 01:02:22,720
That's great.

2102
01:02:23,220 --> 01:02:24,460
Ahhhhh!

2103
01:02:24,600 --> 01:02:25,200
My veil!

2104
01:02:25,200 --> 01:02:25,520
Wait.

2105
01:02:25,520 --> 01:02:26,160
Okay, I'm across.

2106
01:02:26,160 --> 01:02:26,840
Forget it.

2107
01:02:26,940 --> 01:02:28,540
(I can do it)

2108
01:02:28,720 --> 01:02:29,800
Come on, positive energy.

2109
01:02:29,800 --> 01:02:31,080
Okay, last one.

2110
01:02:31,240 --> 01:02:31,880
Come on, bro!

2111
01:02:31,880 --> 01:02:32,540
(Last one)

2112
01:02:33,160 --> 01:02:36,400
Come on!

2113
01:02:36,400 --> 01:02:37,280
Positive energy!

2114
01:02:37,520 --> 01:02:38,480
Come back, bro!

2115
01:02:40,640 --> 01:02:41,040
Go.

2116
01:02:44,240 --> 01:02:44,800
Come on!

2117
01:02:44,860 --> 01:02:45,900
(Stumbling his way toward you)

2118
01:02:45,920 --> 01:02:46,900
(Makes it before landing)
Okay.

2119
01:02:46,920 --> 01:02:47,480
You got it.

2120
01:02:48,160 --> 01:02:49,080
Did we make it?

2121
01:02:49,500 --> 01:02:52,540
(Did everyone finish
the relay within 90 seconds?)

2122
01:02:52,800 --> 01:02:53,480
Success!

2123
01:02:53,580 --> 01:02:54,980
(Third round passed.
This memory space can now be unlocked.)

2124
01:02:56,440 --> 01:02:57,000
Nice.

2125
01:03:03,560 --> 01:03:05,720
I'm sure you've all felt

2126
01:03:05,720 --> 01:03:07,640
how much thought we've put into

2127
01:03:07,640 --> 01:03:08,880
our nursing home's treatment methods.

2128
01:03:09,520 --> 01:03:12,480
(Challenges are part of the treatment)
They fill us with love and strength.

2129
01:03:12,760 --> 01:03:13,880
We also believe

2130
01:03:13,880 --> 01:03:15,680
that everyone can be healed
by their surroundings,

2131
01:03:15,680 --> 01:03:16,920
healed by love,

2132
01:03:16,920 --> 01:03:18,080
and healed by our way of life.

2133
01:03:18,080 --> 01:03:18,640
Right?

2134
01:03:18,800 --> 01:03:19,600
Right.

2135
01:03:20,280 --> 01:03:21,680
Now, the first challenge

2136
01:03:21,680 --> 01:03:23,720
was to get everyone to sleep on time,

2137
01:03:23,720 --> 01:03:25,880
so your families wouldn't worry.

2138
01:03:26,640 --> 01:03:27,880
Families wouldn't worry?

2139
01:03:28,360 --> 01:03:30,320
People nowadays have irregular routines,

2140
01:03:30,320 --> 01:03:31,320
skip meals,

2141
01:03:31,320 --> 01:03:32,320
and don't sleep on time,

2142
01:03:32,320 --> 01:03:33,800
eventually wearing down

2143
01:03:33,800 --> 01:03:35,000
both themselves and their families.

2144
01:03:35,360 --> 01:03:38,520
So we have everyone wake up on time,

2145
01:03:38,520 --> 01:03:39,640
eat on time,

2146
01:03:39,640 --> 01:03:41,000
and sleep on time.

2147
01:03:41,440 --> 01:03:43,760
Even if you can't sleep,
you have to fall asleep.

2148
01:03:44,320 --> 01:03:46,520
You have to do everything

2149
01:03:46,520 --> 01:03:47,720
a normal person should do.

2150
01:03:47,720 --> 01:03:50,380
(Do everything
a normal person should do.)

2151
01:03:50,680 --> 01:03:52,160
Now, the second challenge

2152
01:03:52,760 --> 01:03:54,320
was the Friendship and Support activity.

2153
01:03:54,920 --> 01:03:57,440
(Night Vision Mode)
To help everyone support each other.

2154
01:03:57,440 --> 01:03:58,720
and face their pain.

2155
01:03:58,720 --> 01:04:00,920
We pair everyone up,

2156
01:04:00,920 --> 01:04:01,880
so they can help each other

2157
01:04:02,280 --> 01:04:05,240
and talk about their fears and pain.

2158
01:04:05,240 --> 01:04:07,800
In psychology,
there's a term called desensitization.

2159
01:04:07,800 --> 01:04:09,360
If you say something painful once,

2160
01:04:09,360 --> 01:04:10,400
then say it ten times,

2161
01:04:10,760 --> 01:04:12,280
it may not seem so overwhelming anymore.

2162
01:04:14,920 --> 01:04:16,200
The third challenge

2163
01:04:16,920 --> 01:04:18,760
was Positive Energy Exercise.

2164
01:04:19,320 --> 01:04:22,600
It was meant to encourage everyone
to live a brighter, more positive life.

2165
01:04:22,600 --> 01:04:23,960
Some patients may feel

2166
01:04:23,960 --> 01:04:25,400
that shouting those positive slogans

2167
01:04:25,400 --> 01:04:27,040
is silly or embarrassing.

2168
01:04:27,040 --> 01:04:27,840
But trust me,

2169
01:04:28,440 --> 01:04:31,360
the more they say them, the more
they really start to believe them.

2170
01:04:35,400 --> 01:04:36,880
I believe

2171
01:04:36,880 --> 01:04:38,680
the happiness you felt today

2172
01:04:38,680 --> 01:04:41,440
must have come
from our treatment methods.

2173
01:04:41,780 --> 01:04:45,660
(The treatment methods bring happiness)

2174
01:04:46,080 --> 01:04:48,280
Everyone did great today.

2175
01:04:48,760 --> 01:04:49,920
Keep it up.

2176
01:04:49,920 --> 01:04:51,200
Tomorrow will be even better.

2177
01:04:51,200 --> 01:04:52,160
Okay.

2178
01:04:53,620 --> 01:04:54,420
(Every Friday at 12PM
for more behind-the-scenes moments)

2179
01:04:54,420 --> 01:04:55,140
(See more exciting behind-the-scenes
moments from the players)

2180
01:04:55,160 --> 01:04:56,280
I feel like the three things
she mentioned

2181
01:04:56,280 --> 01:04:57,360
still point to who

2182
01:04:57,360 --> 01:04:58,400
S really is.

2183
01:05:00,400 --> 01:05:02,960
Her targeted treatment plan.

2184
01:05:02,960 --> 01:05:05,960
First, getting this person
to sleep early.

2185
01:05:06,280 --> 01:05:07,280
First is insomnia.

2186
01:05:07,280 --> 01:05:08,840
Right, no matter what,
they had to fall asleep.

2187
01:05:09,320 --> 01:05:10,400
Second is socializing.

2188
01:05:10,400 --> 01:05:11,480
And what was the third?

2189
01:05:12,600 --> 01:05:14,200
Positive energy.

2190
01:05:14,460 --> 01:05:18,420
(What do the three challenges
have to do with ESC?)

2191
01:05:20,920 --> 01:05:21,440
A key.

2192
01:05:21,740 --> 01:05:23,580
(Found a key)

2193
01:05:23,960 --> 01:05:24,520
A key.

2194
01:05:26,200 --> 01:05:26,920
What does this key unlock?

2195
01:05:26,920 --> 01:05:27,360
No idea.

2196
01:05:27,480 --> 01:05:28,880
It's voice-activated.

2197
01:05:30,920 --> 01:05:31,600
Could it be this?

2198
01:05:36,760 --> 01:05:37,040
It's this.

2199
01:05:37,660 --> 01:05:40,180
(Phone, Documents)

2200
01:05:41,000 --> 01:05:43,560
Tui City Morning News.

2201
01:05:44,120 --> 01:05:45,960
Leaving the hospital isn't the end,
but a new beginning.

2202
01:05:46,560 --> 01:05:48,480
Tui Healing Sanatorium

2203
01:05:48,480 --> 01:05:50,880
