2479
01:13:03,160 --> 01:13:03,760
Look at this.

2480
01:13:04,120 --> 01:13:04,720
Look at this.

2481
01:13:04,720 --> 01:13:05,540
(Proud)

2482
01:13:05,600 --> 01:13:06,120
A real needle.

2483
01:13:06,720 --> 01:13:08,800
You're so childish.

2484
01:13:10,280 --> 01:13:12,800
Should we go to the CT room

2485
01:13:12,800 --> 01:13:14,320
