2486
01:13:14,680 --> 01:13:16,040
CT room.

2487
01:13:16,200 --> 01:13:18,600
(CT Room)
Radiation hazard. Do not enter.

2488
01:13:18,760 --> 01:13:20,280
There's also a six-letter code.

2489
01:13:20,280 --> 01:13:21,200
(Six-letter lock)
It's a letter lock.

2490
01:13:21,760 --> 01:13:22,720
Then it should be

2491
01:13:22,720 --> 01:13:24,040
(Golden Treatment: Tui Healing Trilogy)
the Tui Healing Trilogy?

2492
01:13:25,320 --> 01:13:25,840
Could be.

2493
01:13:25,840 --> 01:13:26,520
That must be it.

2494
01:13:27,280 --> 01:13:28,040
Let's go check.

2495
01:13:30,000 --> 01:13:30,480
Here.

2496
01:13:31,680 --> 01:13:32,400
TZY.

2497
01:13:33,100 --> 01:13:34,620
(Trying TZYSBQ, Tui Healing Trilogy)

2498
01:13:35,920 --> 01:13:36,320
Nope.

2499
01:13:36,320 --> 01:13:37,280
It's not the Tui Healing Trilogy.

2500
01:13:37,280 --> 01:13:39,320
Neither three-letter set
has Z in the middle.

2501
01:13:39,320 --> 01:13:41,240
Liu and Wang?

2502
01:13:41,240 --> 01:13:41,920
No way.

2503
01:13:42,320 --> 01:13:43,640
Is there an order?

2504
01:13:43,640 --> 01:13:44,960
Wang...

2505
01:13:44,960 --> 01:13:46,240
(Successful Cases)
Wang, Yu, Fang.

2506
01:13:46,240 --> 01:13:47,120
W.

2507
01:13:47,120 --> 01:13:47,520
Not W.

2508
01:13:47,520 --> 01:13:48,400
Y.

2509
01:13:48,400 --> 01:13:49,320
F.

2510
01:13:50,200 --> 01:13:50,840
There's no Y.

2511
01:13:52,320 --> 01:13:53,280
Z-Chasers.

2512
01:13:53,960 --> 01:13:55,120
There's no Z.

2513
01:13:55,260 --> 01:13:57,900
(What is the CT room code?)

2514
01:13:57,920 --> 01:14:00,120
The goal is to heal us.

2515
01:14:00,400 --> 01:14:02,240
Or is it to deceive all seven of us?

2516
01:14:02,680 --> 01:14:03,280
Punishment.

2517
01:14:03,920 --> 01:14:04,800
Punishing others.

2518
01:14:05,600 --> 01:14:06,400
You mean punishing others?

2519
01:14:06,400 --> 01:14:06,960
Punishing us,

2520
01:14:06,960 --> 01:14:07,680
(Purpose of Tui Healing Sanatorium:)
Loading.

2521
01:14:07,680 --> 01:14:08,560
(Punish Loading)
Punish Loading.

2522
01:14:09,320 --> 01:14:10,280
Revenge.

2523
01:14:10,800 --> 01:14:11,920
Revenge.

2524
01:14:11,920 --> 01:14:13,040
(The password is Revenge)

2525
01:14:13,040 --> 01:14:13,960
Too many letters.

2526
01:14:13,960 --> 01:14:14,680
Seven letters.

2527
01:14:14,680 --> 01:14:15,740
(The password has only 6 letters.)
Not that many.

2528
01:14:16,120 --> 01:14:16,720
What about fuchou?

2529
01:14:16,740 --> 01:14:18,160
(Could the password be fuchou?)
Could be.

2530
01:14:18,160 --> 01:14:20,520
Yeah, fuchou. The first syllable is fu,
the second is chou.

2531
01:14:21,080 --> 01:14:21,760
I'm missing U.

2532
01:14:21,760 --> 01:14:22,920
Do you have U?

2533
01:14:22,920 --> 01:14:23,360
Yes.

2534
01:14:23,920 --> 01:14:25,480
I've got HOU.

2535
01:14:25,480 --> 01:14:25,840
Right?

2536
01:14:27,320 --> 01:14:27,720
O.

2537
01:14:27,720 --> 01:14:28,320
That's definitely it.

2538
01:14:28,560 --> 01:14:29,080
Yes!

2539
01:14:29,880 --> 01:14:30,320
Bravo!

2540
01:14:30,320 --> 01:14:31,280
That's great!

2541
01:14:33,620 --> 01:14:35,260
(Success!)

2542
01:14:35,280 --> 01:14:36,360
It really is Fuchou.

2543
01:14:37,680 --> 01:14:38,640
Fuchou.

2544
01:14:42,280 --> 01:14:42,800
What's this?

2545
01:14:51,920 --> 01:14:53,080
What kind of banner is this?

2546
01:14:53,920 --> 01:14:55,440
Presented for outstanding
medical ethics.

2547
01:14:55,440 --> 01:14:56,400
Skilled healer.

2548
01:14:56,620 --> 01:14:59,060
(Why is the CT room filled with these?)

2549
01:14:59,080 --> 01:14:59,840
This is fake.

2550
01:14:59,840 --> 01:15:01,320
This isn't a CT room.

2551
01:15:01,440 --> 01:15:03,840
It's part of the fake hospital
they built.

2552
01:15:03,840 --> 01:15:04,760
They made this...

2553
01:15:04,760 --> 01:15:05,840
they made this trap.

2554
01:15:05,840 --> 01:15:07,080
They haven't even finished building it.

2555
01:15:07,100 --> 01:15:08,840
(Confirmed: The sanatorium is fake.)

2556
01:15:08,840 --> 01:15:10,360
Let's go back to the ward and discuss.

2557
01:15:10,360 --> 01:15:11,120
Okay.

2558
01:15:11,120 --> 01:15:13,700
(Fortune)

2559
01:15:13,840 --> 01:15:16,080
The seven of us were locked up here

2560
01:15:16,080 --> 01:15:18,960
by criminals who refused to admit

2561
01:15:18,960 --> 01:15:21,000
they were wrong and wanted

2562
01:15:21,000 --> 01:15:22,120
to wipe out our Loading Group

2563
01:15:22,120 --> 01:15:23,240
and take down all the bad guys

2564
01:15:23,240 --> 01:15:24,480
once and for all.

2565
01:15:24,480 --> 01:15:28,440
The ESC discovered
that this was all a trap.

2566
01:15:28,440 --> 01:15:30,360
Maybe one day, he walked into that room

2567
01:15:30,360 --> 01:15:30,960
and realized

2568
01:15:31,440 --> 01:15:34,400
it was just a half-built set.

2569
01:15:34,400 --> 01:15:39,540
(Theory: ESC discovered
that the nursing home was fake)

2570
01:15:40,320 --> 01:15:40,680
Wait,

2571
01:15:40,680 --> 01:15:41,320
I have a question.

2572
01:15:41,320 --> 01:15:42,880
Does this hospital actually
give out medicine?

2573
01:15:43,880 --> 01:15:45,680
EMO Fly Away.

2574
01:15:45,680 --> 01:15:48,300
(EMO Fly Away)

2575
01:15:48,320 --> 01:15:50,440
Because it involves
the medication switch.

2576
01:15:50,920 --> 01:15:52,040
ESC switched the medicine.

2577
01:15:52,600 --> 01:15:53,200
No.

2578
01:15:53,200 --> 01:15:54,320
If this hospital is fake,

2579
01:15:54,320 --> 01:15:55,720
then this medicine may not

2580
01:15:55,720 --> 01:15:56,520
have been switched by ESC.

2581
01:15:56,960 --> 01:15:57,800
It was fake medicine.

2582
01:15:57,800 --> 01:15:59,080
Right, it was fake medicine all along.

2583
01:15:59,080 --> 01:16:01,120
Even ESC didn't know these were candies.

2584
01:16:01,640 --> 01:16:02,600
(Theory: EMO Fly Away was fake medicine)
Because ESC

2585
01:16:02,600 --> 01:16:03,960
(ESC did not switch the medicine)
is one of us.

2586
01:16:03,960 --> 01:16:05,200
He was actually trying to help us.

2587
01:16:05,200 --> 01:16:06,840
He was tricked into coming here too.

2588
01:16:07,120 --> 01:16:07,920
Exactly.

2589
01:16:07,920 --> 01:16:10,580
(Did ESC really switch
Li Attention's medicine?)

2590
01:16:10,860 --> 01:16:11,760
(ESC Memory Fragment 2: Secret Unlocked)

2591
01:16:11,760 --> 01:16:12,920
(The nursing home was faked
by those punished by Loading)

2592
01:16:12,920 --> 01:16:13,740
(To take revenge on Loading)

2593
01:16:13,740 --> 01:16:15,480
(ESC sensed something
was wrong but could not get help)

2594
01:16:15,480 --> 01:16:17,020
(Unclear whether ESC switched
Li Attention's medicine)

2595
01:16:18,380 --> 01:16:19,340
Oh!

2596
01:16:19,920 --> 01:16:20,760
(Night Vision Mode)
What's going on?

2597
01:16:20,760 --> 01:16:21,280
Come here.

2598
01:16:22,020 --> 01:16:22,660
It's fine.

2599
01:16:22,660 --> 01:16:23,300
Hold on.

2600
01:16:23,300 --> 01:16:24,300
(Ding has grown)

2601
01:16:25,460 --> 01:16:27,380
(But not by much)

2602
01:16:30,760 --> 01:16:32,440
It's those three.

2603
01:16:32,440 --> 01:16:34,640
Yu, Fang, and Zhao.

2604
01:16:34,640 --> 01:16:35,240
What?

2605
01:16:35,260 --> 01:16:37,700
(Why did they suddenly appear
in the memory fragment?)

2606
01:16:40,240 --> 01:16:44,160
So what if you know who we are?

2607
01:16:44,640 --> 01:16:46,960
No one would believe

2608
01:16:46,960 --> 01:16:51,200
