2609
01:16:51,200 --> 01:16:52,560
has to say.

2610
01:16:58,160 --> 01:16:59,320
No one would believe what?

2611
01:17:00,020 --> 01:17:03,900
(What other secrets does
ESC have yet to reveal?)

2612
01:17:21,460 --> 01:17:22,380
(Heart in Sync, Worlds Apart)

2613
01:17:22,400 --> 01:17:23,320
Library.

2614
