Why is it taking so long?

2627
01:17:42,040 --> 01:17:43,480
He must be struggling to decide.

2628
01:17:43,840 --> 01:17:44,840
What's wrong? Why are you laughing?

2629
01:17:45,200 --> 01:17:46,000
Didn't expect that.

2630
01:17:47,680 --> 01:17:49,160
I actually guessed it right.

2631
01:17:49,160 --> 01:17:50,240
What did you get right?

2632
01:17:50,240 --> 01:17:51,920
Guys, I think He is suspicious.

2633
01:17:51,920 --> 01:17:53,360
He sat in the wrong spot
when he came in.

2634
01:17:53,360 --> 01:17:54,600
And before he came in,

2635
01:17:54,600 --> 01:17:55,480
I clearly told him,

2636
01:17:55,480 --> 01:17:56,880
He, when we go in,

2637
01:17:56,880 --> 01:17:57,960
