2660
01:18:31,720 --> 01:18:32,880
You're just playing dirty.

2661
01:18:32,880 --> 01:18:33,880
That's just your opinion.

2662
01:18:33,880 --> 01:18:35,160
I think we can agree on one thing.

2663
01:18:35,360 --> 01:18:36,840
This can't help us

2664
01:18:36,840 --> 01:18:38,360
rule out anyone
